jc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TheBadshahKid/ai-resume-builder/commit/bba287d0aedb91a99ed816548f8fca10cb29ea45","sha":"bba287d0aedb91a99ed816548f8fca10cb29ea45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheBadshahKid/ai-resume-builder/commits/bba287d0aedb91a99ed816548f8fca10cb29ea45"}],"sha":"c82335fd8fa0feaca301c94832441fcf3c5a79b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheBadshahKid/ai-resume-builder/commits/c82335fd8fa0feaca301c94832441fcf3c5a79b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheBadshahKid/ai-resume-builder/commits/bba287d0aedb91a99ed816548f8fca10cb29ea45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:47:40Z","email":"saksham@example.com","name":"TheBadshahKid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:47:40Z","email":"saksham@example.com","name":"TheBadshahKid"},"message":"fix: smart improve, suggested skills, job match % + projects form\n\n- ATSAnalyzer: replaced raw number display with animated SVG score rings\n  for both ATS Score and Job Match %, with proper null/undefined safety\n  (shows ''Add JD'' prompt instead of 0% when no job description provided)\n- api.js: expanded local fallback keyword list from 11 to 60+ tech keywords\n  across frontend, backend, cloud, and data categories; implemented\n  cosine-like (Jaccard) similarity for accurate job match percentage\n- server.js: increased OpenAI max_tokens from 100 to 300 to prevent\n  Smart Improve bullets from being cut off mid-sentence; added\n  role-aware skill suggestions in the mock fallback\n- ExperienceForm: added inline Toast notifications for Smart Improve\n  and Auto-generate success/failure (no more silent failures)\n- SkillsForm: added Toast feedback when skills are suggested/added,\n  case-insensitive duplicate detection, ATS skill count indicator\n- ProjectsForm: created new full projects form (replaces ''coming soon'')\n- EditorTabs: wired up ProjectsForm, improved tab title display","tree":{"sha":"a8da21ff98d9441dd4b928b36b2532301f6a