ss 12\nmodules, root README, LICENSE, CONTRIBUTING, .gitignore).\n\nTo use:\n  1. Download the zip from this repo on GitHub.\n  2. Extract: unzip distributed-systems-engineering-labs.zip\n  3. Push to the new repo:\n       cd distributed-systems-engineering\n       git init -b main\n       git add -A\n       git commit -m \"Initial commit\"\n       git remote add origin https://github.com/vishalanandl177/distributed-systems-engineering.git\n       git push -u origin main\n\nAfter upload, this zip can be removed from coderssecret.com.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa","tree":{"sha":"2e0421d5374f1df228e353ab9ff3416d6a54f19c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/2e0421d5374f1df228e353ab9ff3416d6a54f19c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/d6b0b9bcaee8142bf38ba5daa1c654e1fa830356","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e0421d5374f1df228e353ab9ff3416d6a54f19c\nparent 6e491e6191604ec09b023cb6b0d82351f6af6fc8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777828542 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777828542 +0000\n\nAdd distributed-systems-engineering-labs.zip for download\n\nTemporary file. Contains the complete lab repository for the\nDistributed Systems Engineering course (62 files, 36 labs across 12\nmodules, root README, LICENSE, CONTRIBUTING, .gitignore).\n\nTo use:\n  1. Download the zip from this repo on GitHub.\n  2. Extract: unzip distributed-systems-engineering-labs.zip\n  3. Push to the new repo:\n       cd distributed-systems-engineering\n       git init -b main\n       git add -A\n       git commit -m \"Initial commit\"\n       git remote add origin https://github.com/vishalanandl177/distributed-systems-engineering.git\n       git push -u origin main\n\nAfter upload, this zip can be removed from coderssecret.com.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAA