en the edge isn''t\n   stripping client-supplied headers.\n5. CORS wildcard origin combined with credentials — browsers reject\n   it, but the design is still wrong.\n6. Webhook signature verification with == string comparison —\n   classic timing side channel; fix is timingSafeEqual.\n\nEach scenario keeps the established 4-choice / per-choice-feedback /\nproduction-explanation / learn-more pattern.\n\nAlso extracts the reusable ScenarioQuizComponent to\nsrc/app/pages/games/_shared/scenario-quiz.ts so the remaining 7\ncoming-soon games can be built as thin wrappers (theme + intro +\nscenarios data) rather than duplicating ~330 lines of mechanical\ntemplate per game.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa","tree":{"sha":"f603746c3b511c1ea6304337eb682bb1e2f4a966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/f603746c3b511c1ea6304337eb682bb1e2f4a966"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/50152f769a180c705124f4a97999668dd9b6753f","verification":{"payload":"tree f603746c3b511c1ea6304337eb682bb1e2f4a966\nparent 1c760ee981e25df2065dbfa1ac17ac983aaa0094\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777663999 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777663999 +0000\n\nAdd API Attack & Defense simulator + shared scenario-quiz component\n\nThird fully-playable security simulator. Six API security scenarios:\n\n1. JWT algorithm confusion — RS256/HS256 with public-key-as-HMAC-secret\n   when the verify call doesn''t pin algorithms.\n2. OAuth redirect_uri startsWith bypass — attacker registers\n   app.example.com.attacker.com.\n3. Mass assignment / overposting — req.body spread into the ORM update,\n   letting clients set role: admin.\n4. Rate limiter bypass via spoofed X-Forwarded-For when the edge isn''t\n   stripping client-supplied headers.\n5. CORS wildcard origin combined with credentials — browsers reject\n   it, but the design is still wrong.\n6. Webhook signature verification with == string comparison —\n   classic timing side channel; fix is timingSafeEqual.\n\nEach scenario keeps the established 4-choice / per-choice-feedback /\nproduction-explanation / learn-more pattern.\n\nAlso extracts the reusable ScenarioQuizComponent to\nsrc/app/pages/games/_shared/scenario-quiz.ts so the remaining 7\ncoming-soon games can be built as thin wrappers (theme + intro +\nscenarios data) rather than duplicating ~330 lines of mechanical\ntemplate per game.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNcfWlYL\nB1Fjh8qvc+FrTgW/j5lwyfoMoc0RcgA5v0hhi8+ZmbFqlHmyhSJIJmNYwYIEoK3LUvIxzcvkMTCB\nVAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-01T19:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commit/50152f769a180c705124f4a97999668dd9b6753f","node_id":"C_kwDOR5J1D9oAKDUwMTUyZjc2OWExODBjNzA1