d concept tags so the hub indexes\n   for cloud-native security keywords even before all 10 ship.\n\n3. Ships the first fully-playable simulator: Kubernetes Security\n   Simulator. Six production scenarios (RBAC privilege escalation,\n   privileged-pod monitoring agent, missing default-deny\n   NetworkPolicy, secrets-in-Git, mutable image tags, shared\n   namespace tenancy) — each with a real YAML manifest, four\n   plausible answer choices (with feedback per choice), and a\n   production-context explanation linking to the relevant module\n   in the Cloud Native Security Engineering course.\n\n4. Wires up the route at /games/kubernetes-security-simulator,\n   adds the entry to sitemap.xml, and the static-route generator\n   so the page ships with a real <title>, meta description, and\n   semantic HTML for crawlers.\n\n5. Existing games (devops-scenario, linux-challenge, spot-the-bug,\n   guess-output, typing-test, salary-calculator) keep their routes\n   live — no broken URLs, no SEO loss — but are repositioned under\n   \"Foundations & Engineering Drills\" with security-adjacent copy.\n\nBuild verified: 420.3 kB initial, 28.7 kB lazy chunk for the\nnew simulator.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa","tree":{"sha":"ab8693ce2337cde67dd7b6a80bb4c0e86484bd42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/ab8693ce2337cde67dd7b6a80bb4c0e86484bd42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/2fe2d0316adc971fff335901ed9d2bd164f1f93c","verification":{"payload":"tree ab8693ce2337cde67dd7b6a80bb4c0e86484bd42\nparent f648629b2984c416ac48fe47e79e5b9d3a37d9f0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777661019 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777661019 +0000\n\nReposition games as cloud-native security simulators\n\nThe Games hub used to be a generic mini-games collection\n(typing test, salary calculator, etc.) which diluted the brand\nfocus on cloud-native security. This 