ps://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/f648629b2984c416ac48fe47e79e5b9d3a37d9f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T17:58:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T17:58:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Restructure home page as cloud-native security education hub\n\nRepositions the home page from a generic developer blog into a\nproduction-grade cloud-native security learning platform, with the\nsemantic structure, internal linking, and topical authority signals\nneeded to rank for cloud-native security keywords.\n\nHeading hierarchy\n- Single H1: \"Master Cloud Native Security & Production Engineering\"\n- 7 prescribed H2 sections, each with aria-labelledby & a semantic id:\n  1. Learn Cloud Native Security Through Practical Engineering\n     (3 H3 pillars + 4 H4 capability tiles)\n  2. Production Courses on Kubernetes, Zero Trust & Workload Identity\n     (3 H3 course cards + 4 H4 building blocks)\n  3. Cloud Native Security Topics You''ll Learn\n     (5 H3 topic cards with descriptions and links)\n  4. Beginner-Friendly Learning Paths for Modern Infrastructure Security\n     (3 H3 method cards + 3 progression cards: beginner/intermediate/advanced)\n  5. Explore Cloud Native Security Architecture & Diagrams\n     (3 H3 cards with inline SVG architecture previews)\n  6. Designed for Backend, Platform & DevOps Engineers\n     (3 H3 framing + 5 audience role cards)\n  7. Why Cloud Native Security Matters\n     (3 H3 essay sections with educational long-form content)\n\nTopical authority & internal linking\n- Cross-links to /courses/mastering-spiffe-spire,\n  /courses/cloud-native-security-engineering,\n  /courses/kubernetes-runtime-security,\n  /courses/zero-trust-kubernetes,\n  /courses/machine-identity-management, and individual modules.\n- Glossary cross-links for SPIFFE, SPIRE, mTLS, OPA, Falco,\n  Service Mesh, Workload Identity, Zero Trust.\n- Cheatsheets and category pages linked for crawlability.\n\nFAQ section\n- Replaced the generic blog FAQs with 6 educational cloud-native FAQs\n  (cloud native security, workload identity, SPIFFE/SPIRE, why\n  Kubernetes security, Zero Trust, service-to-service auth) plus\n  4 supporting FAQs. FAQPage JSON-LD continues to be injected from\n  the same array.\n\nVisual & UX\n- Each section has a topic-coloured badge, gradient accent on the H2,\n  consistent card grid, hover lift, and an explicit CTA link out.\n- Inline SVG architecture previews keep the page light (no image\n  requests) and crisp at any resolution.\n- All decorative SVGs marked aria-hidden; sections use\n  aria-labelledby for screen-reader navigation.\n- Trending Topics section condensed to make room for the new\n  educational sections without bloating the page.\n\nAccessibility & SEO hygiene\n- Semantic <article> for each topic/course card.\n- aria-label on grouping containers (capability tiles, audience\n  cards, progression cards).\n- All gradients applied via Tailwind classes (no inline styles).\n- Production build verified: 416.7 kB initial bundle, home chunk\n  86.6 kB.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa","tree":{"sha":"974b9b08bf26f99f9682d5695d483ad645d467be","url":"h