entity-management, and individual modules.\n- Glossary cross-links for SPIFFE, SPIRE, mTLS, OPA, Falco,\n  Service Mesh, Workload Identity, Zero Trust.\n- Cheatsheets and category pages linked for crawlability.\n\nFAQ section\n- Replaced the generic blog FAQs with 6 educational cloud-native FAQs\n  (cloud native security, workload identity, SPIFFE/SPIRE, why\n  Kubernetes security, Zero Trust, service-to-service auth) plus\n  4 supporting FAQs. FAQPage JSON-LD continues to be injected from\n  the same array.\n\nVisual & UX\n- Each section has a topic-coloured badge, gradient accent on the H2,\n  consistent card grid, hover lift, and an explicit CTA link out.\n- Inline SVG architecture previews keep the page light (no image\n  requests) and crisp at any resolution.\n- All decorative SVGs marked aria-hidden; sections use\n  aria-labelledby for screen-reader navigation.\n- Trending Topics section condensed to make room for the new\n  educational sections without bloating the page.\n\nAccessibility & SEO hygiene\n- Semantic <article> for each topic/course card.\n- aria-label on grouping containers (capability tiles, audience\n  cards, progression cards).\n- All gradients applied via Tailwind classes (no inline styles).\n- Production build verified: 416.7 kB initial bundle, home chunk\n  86.6 kB.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0126dj1HZL7BMD66DmDm6DUa\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO0Vs1B0\nbwLYqmVcW1bkCVTY3xM06ClrQrLpxWJyY5KZK14dpXtWWmd4GINKfV6Ri9cwuNuK4q+Y7vB5egb2\nSAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-01T17:58:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.g