me page was importing the entire course.model.ts (418KB) just to\ncompute 2 numbers: totalCourseModules=45, totalLabs=130.\n\nFix: hardcode these stats instead of importing 418KB of course data.\nComment added to remind to update when adding/removing courses.\n\nHome page download:\n  Before: 90 + 10 + 48 + 418 = ~566 KB\n  After:  90 + 10 + 48 = ~148 KB (74% reduction)\n\nThe 418KB course model chunk still exists for course pages — it just\nno longer loads on the home page.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"68e7ef220bade581a751900ea230e1ccc5f9ed63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/68e7ef220bade581a751900ea230e1ccc5f9ed63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/f0d927cf055d5e5d14cf5631d2e26f50f40ace52","verification":{"payload":"tree 68e7ef220bade581a751900ea230e1ccc5f9ed63\nparent ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617991 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617991 +0000\n\nRemove 418KB course model import from home page (74% page load reduction)\n\nHome page was importing the entire course.model.ts (418KB) just to\ncompute 2 numbers: totalCourseModules=45, totalLabs=130.\n\nFix: hardcode these stats instead of importing 418KB of course data.\nComment added to remind to update when adding/removing courses.\n\nHome page download:\n  Before: 90 + 10 + 48 + 418 = ~566 KB\n  After:  90 + 10 + 48 = ~148 KB (74% reduction)\n\nThe 418KB course model chunk still exists for course pages — it just\nno longer loads on the home page.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCwpGVtv\n8zuweJ9rDbaxF1grIAbyGgYewIZ8nckeUi2yR5hksAZOd71efwM7rpm2wGAFvdqgbxkf9dYSMQPB\nKws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-01T06:46:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commit/f0d927cf055d5e5d14cf5631d2e26f50f40ace52","node_id":"C_kwDOR5J1D9oAKGYwZDkyN2NmMDU1ZDVlNWQxNGNmNTYzMWQyZTI2ZjUwZjQwYWNlNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commit/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d","sha":"ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d"}],"sha":"f0d927cf055d5e5d14cf5631d2e26f50f40ace52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/f0d927cf055d5e5d14cf5631d2e26f50f40ace52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:42:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:42:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Split blog-post.model.ts into metadata + 80 individual content files\n\nPerformance improvement: 97% reduction in metadata model size.\n\nBefore:\n  blog-post.model.ts: 1,423 KB (80 posts with full HTML content)\n  Every page that imports BLOG_POSTS downloads ALL 80 posts'' content\n  Single blog page: ~300KB transfer (entire model)\n\nAfter:\n  blog-post.model.ts: 48 KB (metadata only — titles, slugs, tags, excerpts)\n  blog-content/<slug>.ts: 80 individual files (~10-30 KB each)\n  Single blog page: ~15-30 KB transfer (only that post''s content)\n\nArchitecture:\n  src/app/models/\n    blog-post.model.ts         → 48 KB (metadata: id, title, slug, tags, etc.)\n    blog-content/\n      database-indexing-*.ts   → 15 KB (just the HTML content for this post)\n      docker-multi-stage-*.ts  → 18 KB\n      ... (80 files)\n\nHow it works:\n  - blog-list, home, search: import metadata only (48 KB) — fast\n  - blog-post component: dynamic import() loads content for ONE post on demand\n  - auto-slides: same dynamic import pattern\n  - Each post is its own Angular lazy chunk (~15-30 KB)\n\nSEO impact:\n  - Blog pages load 90-95% less JavaScript\n  - Better LCP, better Core Web Vitals, better mobile performance\n  - Google rewards faster pages with higher rankings\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"b42d438861eada8ead6e78ef7dc6e2a80290f524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/b42d438861eada8ead6e78ef7dc6e2a80290f524"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d","verification":{"payload":"tree b42d438861eada8ead6e78ef7dc6e2a80290f524\nparent 7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617749 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617749 +0000\n\nSplit blog-post.model.ts into metadata + 80 individual content files\n\nPerformance improvement: 97% reduction in metadata model size.\n\nBefore:\n  blog-post.model.ts: 1,423 KB (80 posts with full HTML content)\n  Every page that imports BLOG_POSTS downloads ALL 80 posts'' content\n  Single blog page: ~300KB transfer (entire model)\n\nAfter:\n  blog-post.model.ts: 48 KB (metadata only — titles, slugs, tags, excerpts)\n  blog-content/<slug>.ts: 80 individual files (~10-30 KB each)\n  Single blog page: ~15-30 KB transfer (only that post''s content)\n\nArchitecture:\n  src/app/models/\n    blog-post.model.ts         → 48 KB (metadata: id, title, slug, tags, etc.)\n    blog-content/\n      database-indexing-*.ts   → 15 KB (just the HTML content for this post)\n      docker-multi-stage-*.ts  → 18 KB\n      ... (80 files)\n\nHow it works:\n  - blog-list, home, search: import metadata only (48 KB) — fast\n  - blog-post component: dynamic import() loads content for ONE post on demand\n  - auto-slides: same dynamic import pattern\n  - Each post is its own Angular lazy chunk (~15-30 KB)\n\nSEO impact:\n  - Blog pages load 90-95% less JavaScript\n  - Better LCP, better Core Web Vitals, better mobile performance\n  - Google rewards faster pages with higher rankings\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCYraRU0\nximX61ID72akdjIOp1cop8tPcTqre/5vcHizlbp+sk2DnEgRWrhMUrkxiqZjngtkw/0HGB7d28hW\nDAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-01T06:42:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commit/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d","node_id":"C_kwDOR5J1D9oAKGFlNTExODRmMDRiN2E0OTM0OGNiYmNiODg4ZWQwYzA3OGRjYjExNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commit/7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001","sha":"7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001"}],"sha":"ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/ae51184f04b7a49348cbbcb888ed0c078dcb115d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:34:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:34:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Optimize home page: dynamic import for blog/course data\n\nHome page now uses dynamic import() to load BLOG_POSTS and COURSES\nin ngOnInit instead of static imports. This means:\n\n1. Initial page render is instant (layout + hero appear immediately)\n2. Blog data (1.46MB) and course data (435KB) load asynchronously\n3. Cards populate ~100ms after initial render (imperceptible)\n4. Users visiting non-home pages (courses, glossary) never download\n   blog data at all\n\nHome page properties converted from static field initializers to\nsignals populated in async ngOnInit. Template updated to use signal\nsyntax (totalPosts(), categories(), etc.).\n\nBundle impact:\n- Initial: 404KB / 90KB transfer (unchanged — was already optimized)\n- Home chunk: 47KB (just template + logic, no data)\n- Blog data: 1.46MB lazy chunk (loaded on-demand, not on initial load)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"2d1ba5757368a827e31054151d47614929e0da32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/2d1ba5757368a827e31054151d47614929e0da32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/7ca39c2f3cb3c72d361c2c9553ca291fc4499001","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d1ba5757368a827e31054151d47614929e0da32\nparent 76d890279c9ec5837864c8398219207aaa743bd6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617260 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777617260 +0000\n\nOptimize home page: dynamic import for blog/course data\n\nHome page now uses dynamic import() to load BLOG_POSTS and COURSES\nin ngOnInit instead of static imports. This means:\n\n1. Initial page render is instant (layout + hero appear immediately)\n2. Blog data (1.46MB) and course data (435KB) load asynchronously\n3. Cards populate ~100ms after initial render (imperceptible)\n4. Users visiting non-home pages (courses, glossary) never download\n   blog data at all\n\nHome page properties converted from static field initializers to\nsignals populated in async ngOnInit. Template updated to use signal\nsyntax (totalPosts(), categories(), etc.).\n\nBundle impact:\n- Initial: 404KB / 90KB transfer (unchanged — was already optimized)\n- Home chunk: 47KB (just template + logic, no data)\n- Blog data: 1.46MB lazy chunk (loaded on-demand, not on initial load)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ/xszsx\nezWJBekxkbtaigZB+sXzIuLeYsmt