ers/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/19bc74808e42f1d2180948b196190f2781962708/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:24:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T06:24:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix 5 code quality issues from audit\n\n1. Delete misplaced asset: production-rag-systems-engineering.zip removed\n   from repo root (was temporary download, no consumer)\n\n2. Fix duplicate route: slides/:slug was declared twice in app.routes.ts\n   (lines 25 and 29). Removed the dead duplicate.\n\n3. Respect prefers-color-scheme on first visit: the dark mode inline script\n   now checks window.matchMedia(''(prefers-color-scheme: light)'') when no\n   localStorage theme is set, so users with OS light mode see light theme\n   on first visit instead of always defaulting to dark.\n\n4. Update README stats: \"18+ blog posts\" → \"80+ blog posts\", added courses\n   (3 courses, 45 modules, 130+ labs), glossary (10 pages), and 261\n   pre-rendered pages. Removed stale feature list.\n\n5. (Noted but not changed): GA4 ID is hardcoded — would need env-specific\n   index.html or build-time replacement. deploy.yml has no test/lint step —\n   can be added as a follow-up.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"7dea607aa8b6e931384bacd355c4319c7d651f93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/7dea607aa8b6e931384bacd355c4319c7d651f93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/19bc74808e42f1d2180948b196190f2781962708","verification":{"payload":"tree 7dea607aa8b6e931384bacd355c4319c7d651f93\nparent 228a24dd369fe3e5a1ca18528ae94d5769d52060\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777616648 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777616648 +0000\n\nFix 5 code quality issues from audit\n\n1. Delete misplaced asset: production-rag-systems-engineering.zip removed\n   from repo root (was temporary download, no consumer)\n\n2. Fix duplicate route: slides/:slug was declared twice in app.routes.ts\n   (lines 25 and 29). Removed the dead duplicate.\n\n3. Respect prefers-color-scheme on first visit: the dark mode inline script\n   now checks window.matchMedia(''(prefers-color-scheme: light)'') when no\n   localStorage theme is set, so users with OS light mode see light theme\n   on first visit instead of always defaulting to dark.\n\n4. Update README stats: \"18+ blog posts\" → \"80+ blog posts\", added courses\n   (3 courses, 45 modules, 130+ labs), glossary (10 pages), and 261\n   pre-rendered pages. Removed stale feature list.\n\n5. (Noted but not changed): GA4 ID is hardcoded — would need env-specific\n   index.html or build-time replacement. deploy.yml has no test/lint step —\n   can be added as a follow-up.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOPl66Zz\npegrMJR+MU3cWH2C1aWUsm7ksTnk09TaUgcf6ywtQwaxZZ/UrKYHwT4G3vstrRPVsjUzsRJM1M9p\n4QY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-01T06:24:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6