com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/commits/28fdefdf5560997b899502c5707f70331c98f664/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T19:00:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T19:00:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Production-Grade RAG Systems Engineering course (16 modules, 50+ labs)\n\nThird free course on CodersSecret. Not another chatbot tutorial — production\nRAG architecture, engineering, and deployment.\n\n16 modules:\n1. Introduction to AI & RAG Systems\n2. Foundations of Search & Retrieval (BM25, TF-IDF, vectors)\n3. Embeddings Deep Dive (model selection, optimization)\n4. Vector Databases Engineering (Qdrant, pgvector, HNSW)\n5. Document Processing & Chunking\n6. Building Basic RAG Systems (retrieve-augment-generate pipeline)\n7. Advanced Retrieval Engineering (hybrid search, reranking, Graph RAG)\n8. AI Agents & Agentic RAG (LangGraph, tool calling, multi-agent)\n9. Production RAG Architecture (scaling, multi-tenancy, caching)\n10. RAG Evaluation & Quality (hallucination detection, metrics)\n11. AI Observability Engineering (tracing, token monitoring, cost)\n12. Security for RAG Systems (prompt injection, data leakage)\n13. Deploying RAG Systems (Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD)\n14. Advanced RAG Architectures (multimodal, federated, Graph RAG)\n15. AI Infrastructure & Future Systems (MCP, agent identity)\n16. Production Capstone (full enterprise RAG platform)\n\nEach module: SVG diagram, labs, keyTakeaways, whyThisMatters, glossary.\n8 FAQs with FAQ schema. 4 SEO pages (what-is-rag, vector-database-comparison,\nhybrid-search-explained, ai-agents-explained).\n\nRoutes, footer link, pre-rendering (261 total pages), sitemap updated.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha"