e\n11. Hands-On Labs — lab cards with objectives\n12. Key Takeaways — summary grid\n13. Career Impact — why this skill matters\n14. End slide — next module or course completion\n\nEach slide type uses appropriate eyebrow labels (Production, Security,\nThink Deeper, Real World, etc.) for visual categorization.\n\nPreviously: slides had 5-8 slides per module (title, objectives, content, labs, takeaways, end)\nNow: slides have 12-18 slides per module with full enrichment content\n\nThis transforms course slides from \"text-heavy summaries\" to\n\"comprehensive visual learning presentations\" with flows, comparisons,\nproduction stories, and architecture thinking.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"b98465538d9d0c7888a64269e8e4612764fbb43a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/b98465538d9d0c7888a64269e8e4612764fbb43a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/8f2bbc0d1605c1041162a27c529cbb49cba35f3d","verification":{"payload":"tree b98465538d9d0c7888a64269e8e4612764fbb43a\nparent ecb03b1e572f46995c6b7c21474cd7c9c3231f66\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777533891 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777533891 +0000\n\nEnrich course slides with diagrams, flows, comparisons, and production content\n\nCourse slides now auto-generate dedicated slides for every enrichment layer:\n\n1. Why This Matters — transformation context slide\n2. Before vs After — visual comparison grid (before/after transformation)\n3. Content sections — extracted from H2 headings (existing)\n4. Real-World Use Cases — grid of practical scenarios\n5. Common Mistakes — grid of pitfalls to avoid\n6. Production Notes — bullet points from field experience\n7. Design Tradeoffs — comparison grid (pros/cons per option)\n8. Security Risks — grid of threats to watch\n9. Think Like an Engineer — architecture thinking questions\n10. Operational Story — production incident narr