ine diagrams + 10 glossary SVGs\n\nBlog diagrams (pipeline-diagram style):\n- [78] GitHub Actions: CI/CD pipeline flow (push → lint → test → build → deploy)\n- [68] Terraform: IaC workflow (write → init → plan → apply → state)\n- [65] Celery: Task queue architecture (Django → Redis → Worker → Result)\n\nGlossary SVG diagrams (inline SVG with role=\"img\" + aria-label for SEO):\n- SPIFFE: identity flow (workload → API → agent → SVID)\n- SPIRE: architecture diagram (server → agents → pods)\n- Zero Trust: 4-layer verification flow\n- Workload Identity: before/after comparison (secret sprawl vs identity)\n- mTLS: mutual authentication handshake flow\n- SVID: X.509 vs JWT format comparison\n- OPA: admission control flow (kubectl → API → Gatekeeper → allow/deny)\n- Falco: runtime detection pipeline (threat → eBPF → alert → response)\n- Service Mesh: sidecar proxy architecture with transparent mTLS\n- Sigstore: keyless image signing flow (build → Fulcio → Cosign → Rekor)\n\nAll SVGs include aria-label attributes for accessibility and SEO.\nZero blogs now have zero visual elements (was 3).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_019fw6HR6bCgbCGj2VaEEsz6","tree":{"sha":"594abcb4eea7774a963af5172169dcf19baa2416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/trees/594abcb4eea7774a963af5172169dcf19baa2416"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vishalanandl177/coderssecret.com/git/commits/ecb03b1e572f46995c6b7c21474cd7c9c3231f66","verification":{"payload":"tree 594abcb4eea7774a963af5172169dcf19baa2416\nparent 3bb8fec02a4be0a011d742a7eb9e5a3a296426d5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777533082 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777533082 +0000\n\nAdd 13 architecture diagrams: 3 blog pipeline diagrams + 10 glossary SVGs\n\nBlog diagrams (pipeline-diagram style):\n- [78] GitHub Actions: CI/CD pipeline flow (push → lint → test → build → deploy)\n- [68] Terraform: IaC workflow (write → init → plan → apply → state)\n- [65] Celery: Task queue arc