o all 13 course modules\n\nTransforms the course from \"good technical documentation\" to \"world-class learning\nplatform\" with educational psychology, transformation storytelling, operational\nrealism, and engineering decision-making layers.\n\nNew content layers added per module:\n1. \"Why This Matters\" — emotional connection + career impact at top of every module\n2. \"Before SPIFFE / After SPIFFE\" — transformation visualization (Modules 1, 13)\n3. \"Real-World Use Cases\" — connecting theory to practical scenarios\n4. \"Production Notes\" — battle-tested operational wisdom (amber-bordered callouts)\n5. \"Common Mistakes\" — failure knowledge that tutorials never teach\n6. \"Security Risks\" — real-world threat awareness\n7. \"Design Tradeoffs\" — X.509-SVID vs JWT-SVID, sidecar vs library vs proxy\n8. \"Production Alternatives\" — SPIFFE vs Vault PKI, vs Istio CA, vs cloud IAM\n9. \"Think Like a Platform Engineer\" — higher-level architecture thinking questions\n10. \"Operational Stories\" — memorable production incident narratives\n11. \"Career Relevance\" — why this skill matters for your career trajectory\n12. \"Glossary / Key Terms\" — quick-reference for intimidating SPIFFE terminology\n13. Lab preview cards with duration and difficulty\n14. \"What You''ll Build\" section on landing page (outcome visualization)\n\nExtended data model interfaces:\n- CourseModule: added 12 new optional fields for enrichment content\n- CourseLab: added duration, difficulty, expectedOutput fields\n\nModule page component:\n- 15 new rendering blocks for all content layers\n- Color-coded sections: cyan (why), red/green (before/after), blue (use cases),\n  amber (production notes), red (mistakes/risks), purple (think), teal (career)\n- Lab cards now show duration and difficulty badges\n\nCourse landing page:\n- Added \"What You''ll Build\" section with 6 outcome cards before transformation section\n\nAll 13 modules enriched with module-specific content for every applicable fie