om/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/2db1d49fe2af2ebdccb64572f65208e46be538f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T08:26:36Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T08:26:36Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: version fallback from build info + xyz-go section in --help\n\n- Version: when main.version is not injected via ldflags, fall back to the\n  Go build info of the main module, so `go install ...@vX.Y.Z` reports the\n  tag version instead of \"dev\" (local source builds report vX.Y.Z+dirty).\n- Help: header now leads with the version; a dedicated \"xyz-go commands\"\n  section documents dj serve (--addr/--bearer/--tls-cert/--tls-key/--cors),\n  dj mcp stdio|sse|http (--addr/--stateless) and dj completion.\n- Invalid inputs (e.g. `dj 0h`) return a clean \"invalid URL\" usage error;\n  audited remaining URL-slicing call sites - all are prefix/length-guarded,\n  no panic paths left.","tree":{"sha":"2d241a0f533eb299d2fcdc8dad397bff9f21dfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/2d241a0f533eb299d2fcdc8dad397bff9f21dfe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/2db1d49fe2af2ebdccb64572f65208e46be538f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d241a0f533eb299d2fcdc8dad397bff9f21dfe9\nparent d6aef5e91358ee3dd446981648d3f13b55115fff\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787387196 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787387196 +0800\n\nfeat: version fallback from build info + xyz-go section in --help\n\n- Version: when main.version is not injected via ldflags, fall back to the\n  Go build info of the main module, so `go install ...@vX.Y.Z` reports the\n  tag version instead of \"dev\" (local source builds report vX.Y.Z+dirty).\n- Help: header now leads with the version; a dedicated \"xyz-go commands\"\n  section documents dj serve (--addr/--bearer/--tls-cert/--tls-key/--cors),\n  dj mcp stdio|sse|http (--addr/--stateless) and dj completion.\n- Invalid inputs (e.g. `dj 0h`) return a clean \"invalid URL\" usage error;\n  audited remaining URL-slicing call sites - all are prefix/length-guarded,\n  no panic paths left.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNcqqntrNWpH9yP9hi9t1oI/39oXnXy5zOc2VPeMv1p4yKXIFdbmUSOU+P9i/MG2nu\nxA9gfJ9tuYA/1pZ906yAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T08:26:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/2db1d49fe2af2ebdccb64572f65208e46be538f6","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDJkYjFkNDlmZTJhZjJlYmRjY2I2NDU3MmY2NTIwOGU0NmJlNTM4ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/d6aef5e91358ee3dd4469816