pends scan when flags come first (`dj -f json <url>`),\nand keeps the legacy flag rewrites (--ua, -debug, --cache words).","tree":{"sha":"cfed0ffd759e2ebc007ca6996db7f5a1f42a660a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/cfed0ffd759e2ebc007ca6996db7f5a1f42a660a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/d6aef5e91358ee3dd446981648d3f13b55115fff","verification":{"payload":"tree cfed0ffd759e2ebc007ca6996db7f5a1f42a660a\nparent e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787368190 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787368190 +0800\n\nchore: upgrade xyz-go to v0.2.3; scan is now the default subcommand\n\nxyz-go v0.2.3 adds CLI.Default: a command flagged default receives the\nwhole argument list when the first token is neither a registered command\nnor a flag. scan is registered as default, so `dj <url> [flags]` is now\nhandled by the library itself instead of the compat shim''s scan prefix.\nThe shim still prepends scan when flags come first (`dj -f json <url>`),\nand keeps the legacy flag rewrites (--ua, -debug, --cache words).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFRFnHPAFihVlAeirwzpogtnoJfMywv7wVP8seBGZjFkjWy/oqQvm5Q6jyYM3vpZH0\nsxAUc6QcGukxOUsMFa7gU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T03:09:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"e