tps://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:00:03Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:00:03Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"ci: re-fetch annotated tag in release job before --notes-from-tag\n\nactions/checkout on a tag trigger overwrites the local tag ref with the\nbare commit SHA (+<sha>:refs/tags/v0.6.0), so gh release create\n--notes-from-tag fell back to the commit message instead of the annotated\ntag message (v0.6.0 release notes were repaired manually via gh release edit).\nRe-fetch the real tag ref after checkout so future releases pick up the\nfull tag annotation.","tree":{"sha":"f99d3bad1d5030da0048c137125c8c192a47146e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/f99d3bad1d5030da0048c137125c8c192a47146e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8","verification":{"payload":"tree f99d3bad1d5030da0048c137125c8c192a47146e\nparent 6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787367603 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787367603 +0800\n\nci: re-fetch annotated tag in release job before --notes-from-tag\n\nactions/checkout on a tag trigger overwrites the local tag ref with the\nbare commit SHA (+<sha>:refs/tags/v0.6.0), so gh release create\n--notes-from-tag fell back to the commit message instead of the annotated\ntag message (v0.6.0 release notes were repaired manually via gh release edit).\nRe-fetch the real tag ref after checkout so future releases pick up the\nfull tag annotation.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHHJHGiLtbxPgrQt3GE8llDeFlqIv/IRn0xl+5jRkr3mSaRyvCfBRdhCxWTJ/nuWoX\nUREMKndbJV/7QqW7v8QQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T03:00:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGUwZDBjMGE0NzAyYWU4M2EwY2YwNGQ1ODk1OTRmNGVmNDBiYjZhYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066","sha":"6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066"}],"sha":"e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e0d0c0a4702ae83a0cf04d589594f4ef40bb6aa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T02:44:28Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T02:44:28Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: integrate xyz-go v0.2.2 (CLI + HTTP API + MCP server)\n\nOne spec.Define(\"scan\") now exposes the scanner through three interfaces:\n- CLI subcommand `dj scan` (legacy `dj [flags] <url>` kept as a compat shim)\n- HTTP REST `dj serve` (POST /scan, /healthz, /openapi.json, /mcp on one port)\n- MCP tool server `dj mcp stdio|sse|http` (structuredContent JSON, textContent md)\n\nCompat shim in main.go preserves old behavior: `--ua`/`--ua=`, `-debug` and\n`--cache` boolean words are normalized, -v/-h/no-args keep the original help\nand version output, and usage errors keep exit code 1. The string-backed\nReport result keeps md/json/text CLI output byte-identical while MarshalJSON\npasses structured JSON through for -f json over HTTP/MCP/--json.\n\nRobustness: the handler rejects non-absolute URLs and getJSCachePath is\nlength-guarded - a scheme-less URL previously panicked the pipeline, which\nwould have taken down the whole HTTP/MCP server process.\n\nbuild.yml ldflags now also set github.com/ejfkdev/xyz-go.Version; READMEs\ndocument the serve and mcp modes.","tree":{"sha":"fba5043d77869ae0d23c4c17934bdd849b99c0bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/fba5043d77869ae0d23c4c17934bdd849b99c0bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066","verification":{"payload":"tree fba5043d77869ae0d23c4c17934bdd849b99c0bf\nparent 7c2f72e3c41138b2794f07ca3d37a3381f753e09\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787366668 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787366668 +0800\n\nfeat: integrate xyz-go v0.2.2 (CLI + HTTP API + MCP server)\n\nOne spec.Define(\"scan\") now exposes the scanner through three interfaces:\n- CLI subcommand `dj scan` (legacy `dj [flags] <url>` kept as a compat shim)\n- HTTP REST `dj serve` (POST /scan, /healthz, /openapi.json, /mcp on one port)\n- MCP tool server `dj mcp stdio|sse|http` (structuredContent JSON, textContent md)\n\nCompat shim in main.go preserves old behavior: `--ua`/`--ua=`, `-debug` and\n`--cache` boolean words are normalized, -v/-h/no-args keep the original help\nand version output, and usage errors keep exit code 1. The string-backed\nReport result keeps md/json/text CLI output byte-identical while MarshalJSON\npasses structured JSON through for -f json over HTTP/MCP/--json.\n\nRobustness: the handler rejects non-absolute URLs and getJSCachePath is\nlength-guarded - a scheme-less URL previously panicked the pipeline, which\nwould have taken down the whole HTTP/MCP server process.\n\nbuild.yml ldflags now also set github.com/ejfkdev/xyz-go.Version; READMEs\ndocument the serve and mcp modes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBSrfp/r7XDTC0IVeIs1PutT59hV4o+J9JuPYe2Aa4EDRaZQ7KSEsCTPcKaE1Kp+Hn\n3lF/AKOgVCedfQ2YD5MwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T02:55:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDY3NDVmZmU3NDVlY2Q3N2IzYjVjMjZmNWNhZTg1MzhiODA4MWMwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/7c2f72e3c41138b2794f07ca3d37a3381f753e09","sha":"7c2f72e3c41138b2794f07ca3d37a3381f753e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/7c2f72e3c41138b2794f07ca3d37a3381f753e09"}],"sha":"6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/6745ffe745ecd77b3b5c26f5cae8538b8081c066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e