lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e925f2e4b83bc13bf8bbb9e54ecb5e53ac0c64ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T01:13:38Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T01:13:38Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"fix: --concurrency now caps ALL HTTP requests, not just JS downloads\n\nPreviously the -c budget only gated the main discovery loop''s goroutines;\nsource-map HEAD+GET probes, RSC flight requests, fragment candidate\nfetches and other fetch paths bypassed it entirely.\n\nNow the Fetcher owns a global semaphore: Fetch / FetchWithStatus /\nFetchWithHeaders / FetchWithStatusHead all acquire a slot, so the\n--concurrency budget governs downloads AND probes uniformly. The\nPipeline-level semaphore was removed (no double budget), and\nSetFetchConcurrency propagates to the underlying fetcher.\n\nHelp text and READMEs updated to describe the global budget.","tree":{"sha":"41f907e2aa18cf6eab085cac79439d469a6e8f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/41f907e2aa18cf6eab085cac79439d469a6e8f15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/e925f2e4b83bc13bf8bbb9e54ecb5e53ac0c64ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 41f907e2aa18cf6eab085cac79439d469a6e8f15\nparent e71b53b2cd26120c0c747aeb0c597c6b78628663\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787102018 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787102018 +0800\n\nfix: --concurrency now caps ALL HTTP requests, not just JS downloads\n\nPreviously the -c budget only gated the main discovery loop''s goroutines;\nsource-map HEAD+GET probes, RSC flight requests, fragment candidate\nfetches and other fetch paths bypassed it entirely.\n\nNow the Fetcher owns a global semaphore: Fetch / FetchWithStatus /\nFetchWithHeaders / FetchWithStatusHead all acquire a slot, so the\n--concurrency budget governs downloads AND probes uniformly. The\nPipeline-level semaphore was removed (no double budget), and\nSetFetchConcurrency propagates to the underlying fetcher.\n\nHelp text and READMEs updated to describe the global budget.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGnpPC5KkbAXfalMMo/6d5AyhvIfnFL9Ci1ssIueDk3XZwg0QSHaxV8oILs8JC3Nnc\nleTpM+KW7FH5GbSOOEFAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T01:13:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"