5e5c51ea16","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGMyZDA0NmJjMTYwNzFkY2M4NDFiOTE4Y2FlZTRhNzVlNWM1MWVhMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650","sha":"e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650"}],"sha":"c2d046bc16071dcc841b918caee4a75e5c51ea16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/c2d046bc16071dcc841b918caee4a75e5c51ea16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:52:36Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:52:36Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: -v/--version + --concurrency, Next sortedPages probes; harness judge fix\n\nCLI:\n- -v/--version prints version and exits; help header includes GitHub URL\n- -c/--concurrency N controls fetch concurrency (default 8, was hardcoded\n  48); range 1-256\n\nPipeline:\n- concurrency semaphore now reads Pipeline.fetchConcurrency (default 8)\n\nNextJSPlugin:\n- when _buildManifest carries sortedPages, issue fixed-name probes per\n  page (RSC flight + plain HTML) — for SSR deployments where the page\n  provider script is server-injected and absent from static refs\n  (turbopack 15.5 provider shape)\n\nHarness (dj_demo):\n- compare.py literal_ref: bare-basename variant only for single-dir\n  bundle paths (assets/, static/js/) so import(\"./X.js\") same-dir\n  literals count as referenced; earlier whole-dir variant overcounted\n  unreachable page-scoped workers and was reverted\n- full regression: PASS 419 / WARN 117 / FAIL 23 (same FAIL set as\n  before; the turbopack /_app provider files remain provably\n  unreachable in static export)","tree":{"sha":"512d4f74cef8632591a429fe70b2f265fe946565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/512d4f74cef8632591a429fe70b2f265fe946565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650","verification":{"payload":"tree 512d4f74cef8632591a429fe70b2f265fe946565\nparent 41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787097156 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787097156 +0800\n\nfeat: -v/--version + --concurrency, Next sortedPages probes; harness judge fix\n\nCLI:\n- -v/--version prints version and exits; help header includes GitHub URL\n- -c/--concurrency N controls fetch concurrency (default 8, was hardcoded\n  48); range 1-256\n\nPipeline:\n- concurrency semaphore now reads Pipeline.fetchConcurrency (default 8)\n\nNextJSPlugin:\n- when _buildManifest carries sortedPages, issue fixed-name probes per\n  page (RSC flight + plain HTML) — for SSR deployments where the page\n  provider script is server-injected and absent from static refs\n  (turbopack 15.5 provider shape)\n\nHarness (dj_demo):\n- compare.py literal_ref: bare-basename variant only for single-dir\n  bundle paths (assets/, static/js/) so import(\"./X.js\") same-dir\n  literals count as referenced; earlier whole-dir variant overcounted\n  unreachable page-scoped workers and was reverted\n- full regression: PASS 419 / WARN 117 / FAIL 23 (same FAIL set as\n  before; the turbopack /_app provider files remain provably\n  unreachable in static export)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCxj1ARxfBls5iFqhC22OSpZi705NrYeYTPfLM2jGfWEiCtkO2yd7AE3zoUq9mTYqR\nWhMpeSMS+s8dpylc1fGQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T23:52:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGU0NTM5ZmNkODZlM2JjMGU4NzhkZGM5Y2RjNzVmNzJiOTMyZTg2NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f","sha":"41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f"}],"sha":"e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/e4539fcd86e3bc0e878ddc9cdc75f72b932e8650"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:23:40Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:23:40Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"fix: scoped chunk maps, transient fetch retries, bounded concurrency, MF root probes\n\nDeep analysis of remaining FAIL clusters (sub-agent reads of bundle\nsources + server logs) found the misses were mostly not missing regexes\nbut three systemic gaps:\n\n1. scoped map extraction (W1): webpack4 dual-map runtimes (JS hash map +\n   CSS twin map in one file) were parsed via whole-content scan, so the\n   CSS map overwrote JS hashes -> every probe 404. requireU branch now\n   captures the two maps from the matched block and parses only them.\n\n2. transient fetch retries (V1): connection timeouts against low-backlog\n   static servers silently dropped URLs and their whole lazy-import\n   sub-chains. processJSContent now retries up to 3x with backoff and\n   retries 429/5xx once. Bounded fetch concurrency (48) prevents the\n   connect-storm that caused the timeouts.\n\n3. MF remote entry root derivation: generalize <remoteEntry>/index.html\n   convention probing to any layout (also covers the root-level\n   remoteEntry.js of vite-plugin-federation 0.0.3, plus webpack-layout\n   remotes with their own entry page).\n\nHarness (80 frameworks / 560 versions):\n  PASS 414 -> 419, FAIL 30 -> 23, WARN 116 -> 118\n  flipped: vue-element-admin 2v PASS (72+73 chunks), amis 4v PASS,\n  tdesign-starter 2v PASS, pig-ui WARN (expected all found),\n  vite-plugin-federation 6v PASS (incl 0.0.3), vue-pure-admin v7 PASS\n  still FAIL after proof-of-unreachability: webpack-mf 10v (remote\n  runtime chunk zero references; even a real browser 404s the remote),\n  snowpack 10v (no-listing policy), turbopack 15.5.23 (provider file\n  zero references in the whole tree), d2admin (UEditor chain + mobile\n  subpage static-unreachable), vue-pure-admin v6 (wasm worker runtime-\n  assembled name)","tree":{"sha":"c269b3d51e0f82b286dd370d4ad6f2af31ae49b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/c269b3d51e0f82b286dd370d4ad6f2af31ae49b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f","verification":{"payload":"tree c269b3d51e0f82b286dd370d4ad6f2af31ae49b8\nparent 7e392ae97c7ee17a5d62b6654d0bd2da40d97b01\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787091820 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787091820 +0800\n\nfix: scoped chunk maps, transient fetch retries, bounded concurrency, MF root probes\n\nDeep analysis of remaining FAIL clusters (sub-agent reads of bundle\nsources + server logs) found the misses were mostly not missing regexes\nbut three systemic gaps:\n\n1. scoped map extraction (W1): webpack4 dual-map runtimes (JS hash map +\n   CSS twin map in one file) were parsed via whole-content scan, so the\n   CSS map overwrote JS hashes -> every probe 404. requireU branch now\n   captures the two maps from the matched block and parses only them.\n\n2. transient fetch retries (V1): connection timeouts against low-backlog\n   static servers silently dropped URLs and their whole lazy-import\n   sub-chains. processJSContent now retries up to 3x with backoff and\n   retries 429/5xx once. Bounded fetch concurrency (48) prevents the\n   connect-storm that caused the timeouts.\n\n3. MF remote entry root derivation: generalize <remoteEntry>/index.html\n   convention probing to any layout (also covers the root-level\n   remoteEntry.js of vite-plugin-federation 0.0.3, plus webpack-layout\n   remotes with their own entry page).\n\nHarness (80 frameworks / 560 versions):\n  PASS 414 -> 419, FAIL 30 -> 23, WARN 116 -> 118\n  flipped: vue-element-admin 2v PASS (72+73 chunks), amis 4v PASS,\n  tdesign-starter 2v PASS, pig-ui WARN (expected all found),\n  vite-plugin-federation 6v PASS (incl 0.0.3), vue-pure-admin v7 PASS\n  still FAIL after proof-of-unreachability: webpack-mf 10v (remote\n  runtime chunk zero references; even a real browser 404s the remote),\n  snowpack 10v (no-listing policy), turbopack 15.5.23 (provider file\n  zero references in the whole tree), d2admin (UEditor chain + mobile\n  subpage static-unreachable), vue-pure-admin v6 (wasm worker runtime-\n  assembled name)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGvtINW/IYZkyagsKX20p6nRggiOoylNa8qhQYh20NYw3znA1iruzuau6mLSS3+8Py\nFSA6MS0O718wZca8eRcw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T22:23:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDQxZTljNmEzMzRlMWIxNWVkMjk2NjljZjFiODRkMDNhNzBhN2Y2MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/7e392ae97c7ee17a5d62b6654d0bd2da40d97b01","sha":"7e392ae97c7ee17a5d62b6654d0bd2da40d97b01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/7e392ae97c7ee17a5d62b6654d0bd2da40d97b01"}],"sha":"41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/41e9c6a334e1b15ed29669cf1b84d03a70a7f60f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/7e392ae97c7ee17a5d62b6654d0bd2da40d97b01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:23:51Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:23:51Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: unquoted prefetch/modulepreload links, config path literals, umi quoted-key maps\n\n- HTMLScriptPlugin: prefetch/modulepreload link extraction accepts\n  unquoted attribute values (<link href=/js/x.js rel=prefetch>),\n  mass prefetch lists in compressed admin templates (jeecg 205 links)\n- UniversalURLPlugin: config/manifest path literals\n  (\"/cdn/font-icon/x.js\", \"assets/xxx.js\", tinymce language_url);\n  monaco/amis resource arrays etc.\n- WebpackPlugin: federation branch gains quoted-numeric map keys\n  (\"185\":\"58b15d06\" / \"185\":\"p__Welcome\" — umi3 async layout)\n  and dynamic suffix ((.async).js)\n\nHarness (80 frameworks, 560 versions):\n  PASS 414 / FAIL 30 / WARN 116\n  flipped: ant-design-pro 5v FAIL->PASS, jeecg 2v FAIL->WARN\n  (expected all found), umi/ng-alain stable\n  remaining FAIL clusters: snowpack 10 (no-listing policy), webpack-mf\n  10 (runtime-slice statically unreachable), plus single-version\n  leftovers: amis 6.13, d2admin, pig-ui, tdesign-starter, turbopack\n  15.5.23, vite-plugin-federation 0.0.3, vue-element-admin x2,\n  vue-pure-admin x2 (next round)","tree":{"sha":"b2a54ba97058c