(build id not statically derivable)","tree":{"sha":"99f22413caf4a31d4a3f7dca32c0a9a49edb4d4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/99f22413caf4a31d4a3f7dca32c0a9a49edb4d4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/718e7538231365899fbcfba7f417e704409aeff1","verification":{"payload":"tree 99f22413caf4a31d4a3f7dca32c0a9a49edb4d4f\nparent 276f161889468287b4c152871278a2e01d16b8a5\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787067619 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787067619 +0800\n\nfix: loopback dev-URL rebase, fragmented root-relative probes, minified ESM precheck\n\n- RebaseLoopbackOrigin: artifacts with baked-in localhost dev-server\n  URLs (http://127.0.0.1:PORT/...) are rebased to the scan origin\n  before download; anchored at baseURL, applied at task-enqueue and\n  the processJSContentURL choke point; urlContext URL field synced to\n  the rebased value (was fetching stale pre-rebase URLs)\n- probeFragment: root-relative fragments always also get domain+path\n  candidates, not only when knownPath suffix match fails (mf-rsbuild\n  host/remote same-named async dirs previously shadowed the host side)\n- ESMImportPlugin Precheck: accept minified import{..}from\"..\" (no\n  space after import) so remoteEntry static imports are extracted\n- UniversalURLPlugin: function-call literal args j(\"/remote/assets/x.js\")\n\nHarness (61 frameworks): FAIL 19, PASS 409, WARN 101\n  mf-rsbuild 8v FAIL->PASS, mf-vite 5F->3P/5W\n  remaining: webpack-mf 10F (remote runtime chunk has zero static\n  references — fixture deployment shape), vite-plugin-federation 6F\n  (one entry chunk referenced only from the remote''s own index.html),\n  turbopack 3F (build id not statically derivable)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQE+9HRRxQIPCU+Bjco