lugin (new):\n- EMP (@efox/emp) bundles carry __MFE_REMOTE__/__EMP__ markers;\n  probe base-dir emp.json (older versions use emp-stats.json) and parse\n  federatedModules[].entry + exposes[].chunks to resolve the runtime\n  library and host chunks (names exist only in the manifest)\n\nHTMLPivotPlugin:\n- expression import prefixes (import(''./templates/''+name) and backtick\n  template form) probed as directory listings; python-http.server style\n  Directory listing pages parsed to enumerate real chunk files\n  (snowpack unbundled ESM sites)\n- directory resolution uses trailing-slash base to keep relative joins\n  directory-aware\n\nPipeline:\n- global HTML intermediate budget (maxHTMLPivots=64) guarding against\n  unbounded multi-page recursion; knowledge.IsSeenURL dedups repeated\n  parses of the same URL\n\nHarness (dj_demo, 55 frameworks / 481 versions):\n  FAIL 13 -> 3, PASS 370 -> 390, WARN 98 -> 88\n  emp 11v (2F/9W -> all extracted), snowpack 10v FAIL->8P/2W\n  remaining 3 FAIL: turbopack static export (buildId unknown statically,\n  manifests not served)","tree":{"sha":"3b638d47633eb21b153a6892fcfc7ec9784fd358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/3b638d47633eb21b153a6892fcfc7ec9784fd358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/1618d6ec8bcf770d3cb96118777384e56a28a2a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b638d47633eb21b153a6892fcfc7ec9784fd358\nparent b6317d511ee1bb9c31dc3122596325de97d33d34\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787061610 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787061610 +0800\n\nfeat: EmpPlugin (emp.json manifest), dir-listing probing for expression imports\n\nEmpPlugin (new):\n- EMP (@efox/emp) bundles carry __MFE_REMOTE__/__EMP__ markers;\n  probe base-dir emp.json (older versions use emp-stats.json) and parse\n  federatedModules[].entry + exposes[].chunks to resolve the runtime\n  library and host chunks (names exist only in the manifest)\n\nHTMLPivotPlugin:\n- expression import prefixes (import(''./templates/''+name) and backtick\n  template form) probed as directory listings; python-http.server style\n  Directory listing pages parsed to enumerate real chunk files\n  (snowpack unbundled ESM sites)\n- directory resolution uses trailing-slash base to keep relative joins\n  directory-aware\n\nPipeline:\n- global HTML intermediate budget (maxHTMLPivots=64) guarding against\n  unbounded multi-page recursion; knowledge.IsSeenURL dedups repeated\n  parses of the same URL\n\nHarness (dj_demo, 55 frameworks / 481 versions):\n  FAIL 13 -> 3, PASS 370 -> 390, WARN 98 -> 88\n  emp 11v (2F/9W -> all extracted), snowpack 10v FAIL->8P/2W\n  remaining 3 FAIL: turbopack static export (buildId unknown statically,\n  manifests not served)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIn7NnLn8h4OM5JcKtDNRk//pN+qr6N3LbfMQ2eUOzaGfqlZQzhxG1Ib4AmyFGXCAP\n0vgGrkhTBQhJ6vkl5abw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T14:00:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions