 + turbopack otherChunks\n\nHTMLPivotPlugin (new):\n- extract same-origin HTML entries from HTML content (<a href>, <link\n  href>, <iframe src> — quoted and unquoted) and from JS content\n  (quoted .html literals, e.g. storybook iframe.html)\n- directory-style links get triple candidates: /page1, /page1/index.html,\n  /page1.html (marko old/new layouts, server route mapping)\n- entries are enqueued as HTML intermediates and recursively processed\n  by the existing script/modulepreload/inline-import plugins\n\nUniversalURLPlugin:\n- variable tracking with constant propagation (multi-pass to fixpoint):\n  var r=\"/remote/remoteEntry.js\"; import(r) and const b=a+\"suffix\" chains\n\nNextJSPlugin:\n- turbopack otherChunks:[\"static/chunks/x.js\",...] dep arrays probed\n  against /_next/ origin\n\nHarness (dj_demo, 55 frameworks / 481 versions):\n  before -> after: FAIL 28 -> 15, PASS 363 -> 368, WARN 90 -> 98\n  marko 5v FAIL->PASS, storybook 8v FAIL->WARN (expected all found),\n  no regressions elsewhere\n  remaining 15 FAIL are statically unreachable: emp 2 (emp.json\n  config discovered by project-name convention, no literal ref),\n  snowpack 10 (expression-import context chunks), turbopack 3\n  (buildId unknown statically + manifests not served)","tree":{"sha":"fc72a26d273959564d4e4a60d193933ae1de477f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/fc72a26d273959564d4e4a60d193933ae1de477f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/b6317d511ee1bb9c31dc3122596325de97d33d34","verification":{"payload":"tree fc72a26d273959564d4e4a60d193933ae1de477f\nparent cf33315e31cd73245c8ffd5d09a0980b88da99d5\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787059311 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787059311 +0800\n\nfeat: recursive HTML entry discovery + variable tracking + turbopack otherChunks\n\nHTMLPivotPlugin (new):\n- extract same-origin HTML entries from HTML content (<a href>, <link\n  href>, <iframe src> — quoted and unquoted) and from JS content\n  (quoted .html literals, e.g. storybook iframe.html)\n- directory-style links get triple candidates: /page1, /page1/index.html,\n  /page1.html (marko old/new layouts, server route mapping)\n- entries are enqueued as HTML intermediates and recursively processed\n  by the existing script/modulepreload/inline-import plugins\n\nUniversalURLPlugin:\n- variable tracking with constant propagation (multi-pass to fixpoint):\n  var r=\"/remote/remoteEntry.js\"; import(r) and const b=a+\"suffix\" chains\n\nNextJSPlugin:\n- turbopack otherChunks:[\"static/chunks/x.js\",...] dep arrays probed\n  against /_next/ origin\n\nHarness (dj_demo, 55 frameworks / 481 versions):\n  before -> after: FAIL 28 -> 15, PASS 363 -> 368, WARN 90 -> 98\n  marko 5v FAIL->PASS, storybook 8v FAIL->WARN (expected all found),\n  no regressions elsewhere\n  remaining 15 FAIL are statically unreachable: emp 2 (emp.json\n  config discovered by project-name convention, no literal ref),\n  snowpack 10 (expression-import context chunks), turbopack 3\n  (buildId unknown statically + manifests not served)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQO2oPjBMXdz3xV+O98vJvlD7BU9Vj/TpZNnHG8tItN76qO7pyQ93Opbh7c6u71pXtA\nZTBJMUz+tfzIiv6+INUww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T13:22:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"