jfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787056495 +0800\n\nfeat: gatsby ternary chunk map, vue-cli string-key maps, Trunk sitemap plugin\n\nWebpackPlugin:\n- add ternary-name-map branch for gatsby runtime shape:\n  (293===e?\"component---xxx\":e)+\"-\"+{id:\"fullhash\",...}[e]+\".js\"\n- share extractChunkNameHashMaps across requireU/federation branches,\n  covering quoted-string and bare-identifier map keys (vue-cli webpack4\n  JSONP runtimes: {\"shared\":\"shared\"} + {\"shared\":\"449c9439\"})\n\nTrunkPlugin (new):\n- Trunk (Rust wasm-bindgen bundler) resolves dynamic routes/workers/\n  chunks through static/sitemap.json fetched at runtime; no literal\n  chunk deps in JS\n- extract sitemap.json reference from fetch() calls, enqueue as JSON\n  intermediate, parse routes[].file / chunks{name:hash} / workers[]\n\nHarness (dj_demo, 55 frameworks / 481 versions final regression):\n  PASS 363 / FAIL 28 / WARN 90\n  flipped by this round: trunk 5v FAIL->PASS, gatsby 5v FAIL->WARN\n  (expected all found), vue-cli 7v PASS, vike 12v PASS (fixture dup-tree\n  removed)\n  remaining 28 FAIL are statically unreachable fixture shapes: emp 2\n  (runtime-assembled URL), marko 5 + storybook 8 (per-route/iframe\n  HTML entries), snowpack 10 (expression imports), turbopack 3\n  (next rspack-style manifest)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMn4I7q6JJ1VI5Uzc3hRAUFQC3sJzlZ2uj+n4N4kdx6pQB/K5LTLZ2C1QJYUTUg8Gu\nh8Vu2czJetZLSN+/WUDQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T12:35:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gis