.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/74f1fa1e6b27a385e320e688f88da36995aa9acb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:46:35Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:46:35Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: webpack-family runtime chunk map + MF manifest + backtick import\n\nWebpackPlugin (webpack/rspack/rsbuild/cra/piral/emp chunks):\n- generic u= chunk-map branch now supports all key forms: numeric,\n  quoted string (\"page2-extra\":\"hash\"), and bare identifier keys\n  (src_views_extra_js:\"hash\"), alphanumeric hash values\n- use the actual separator from \"prefix\"+e+\"SEP\"+{..}[e]+\"suffix\"\n  (webpack5/rspack use ''.'', older code hardcoded ''-'')\n- allow empty prefix (minimal runtime r.u=function(e){return\"\"+e+...})\n  and optional parentheses around inline map ({...})\n- rsbuild-style inline literal maps: (({id:\"name\"..})[e]||e) shapes\n  parsed directly instead of variable-name lookup\n- prepend publicPath (e.g. /remote/) so remote-side chunk fragments\n  resolve via root-relative domain fallback\n- Precheck now accepts minimal webpack5 runtimes without standard\n  webpack markers\n\nModuleFederation:\n- extract remoteEntry.js string refs (initOptions entry / script loader)\n- also try same-dir mf-manifest.json / federation-manifest.json\n- parse standard MF manifest exposes assets (sync+async) with\n  metaData.publicPath to enumerate remote chunks\n\nDynamicImport:\n- support backtick template literal import(`./page1.js`) with ${}\n  guard (TanStack Router style)\n\nHarness regressions (dj_demo, 337 versions):\n  before -> after : PASS 173 -> 304, FAIL 125 -> 20, WARN 33 -> 52\n  flipped to PASS: webpack 18v, rspack 10v, rsbuild 7v, piral 12v,\n  cra 2v, tanstack 1v; MF 11v FAIL->WARN (expected all found)\n  remaining 20 FAIL are statically unreachable fixture shapes only\n  (expression-import context chunks, multi-page route HTML, runtime-\n  assembled library URLs: emp/marko/snowpack/turbopack)","tree":{"sha":"df9f9b3aee80e9996f43e4670ed577a353299731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/df9f9b3aee80e9996f43e4670ed577a353299731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/74f1fa1e6b27a385e320e688f88da36995aa9acb","verification":{"payload":"tree df9f9b3aee80e9996f43e4670ed577a353299731\nparent e26156144250639917f7df13734583ff04a0410c\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787049995 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787049995 +0800\n\nfeat: webpack-family runtime chunk map + MF manifest + backtick import\n\nWebpackPlugin (webpack/rspack/rsbuild/cra/piral/emp chunks):\n- generic u= chunk-map branch now supports all key forms: numeric,\n  quoted string (\"page2-extra\":\"hash\"), and bare identifier keys\n  (src_views_extra_js:\"hash\"), alphanumeric hash values\n- use the actual separator from \"prefix\"+e+\"SEP\"+{..}[e]+\"suffix\"\n  (webpack5/rspack use ''.'', older code hardcoded ''-'')\n- allow empty prefix (minimal runtime r.u=function(e){return\"\"+e+...})\n  and optional parentheses around inline map ({...})\n- rsbuild-style inline literal maps: (({id:\"name\"..})[e]||e) shapes\n  parsed directly instead of variable-name lookup\n- prepend publicPath (e.g. /remote/) so remote-side chunk fragments\n  resolve via root-relative domain fallback\n- Precheck now accepts minimal webpack5 runtimes without standard\n  webpack markers\n\nModuleFederation:\n- extract remoteEntry.js string refs (initOptions entry / script loader)\n- also try same-dir mf-manifest.json / federation-manifest.json\n- parse standard MF manifest exposes assets (sync+async) with\n  metaData.publicPath to enumerate remote chunks\n\nDynamicImport:\n- support backtick template literal import(`./page1.js`) with ${}\n  guard (TanStack Router style)\n\nHarness regressions (dj_demo, 337 versions):\n  before -> after : PASS 173 -> 304, FAIL 125 -> 20, WARN 33 -> 52\n  flipped to PASS: webpack 18v, rspack 10v, rsbuild 7v, piral 12v,\n  cra 2v, tanstack 1v; MF 11v FAIL->WARN (expected all found)\n  remaining 20 FAIL are statically unreachable fixture shapes only\n  (expression-import context chunks, multi-page route HTML, runtime-\n  assembled library URLs: emp/marko/snowpack/turbopack)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLLpUr16/ai/bCN9IkbBc4G6xqhYQau4N+ffolntRZw2F+W3v0f4i34btbZaQBAuFB\nr0pb0NMDa3n2NMhOby9A4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T10:46:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/74f1fa1e6b27a385e320e688f88da36995aa9acb","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDc0ZjFmYTFlNmIyN2EzODVlMzIwZTY4OGY4OGRhMzY5OTVhYTlhY2I","parents