: microApp.start({url})\n- WujiePlugin: startApp({url})\n- IcestarkPlugin: AppRoute url (string and array forms)\n- microapp_helpers.go: shared entry validation / context guard / resolve\n\nAlso add unconditional System.register([''./dep.js'', ...]) dep-array\nextraction to UniversalURLPlugin (single-spa / rollup system-format\nbundles), which was previously shadowed by the seen-set gate.\n\nHarness verdicts (dj_demo) before -> after:\n  single-spa  12x FAIL -> 12x PASS\n  micro-app    8x FAIL ->  8x PASS\n  icestark    11x FAIL -> 11x PASS\n  wujie        3x FAIL ->  3x PASS\n  garfish     10x PASS -> 10x PASS (no regression, now via GarfishPlugin)","tree":{"sha":"aa401b80bc203e54d8393451b773b27c7a4b2eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/aa401b80bc203e54d8393451b773b27c7a4b2eaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/e26156144250639917f7df13734583ff04a0410c","verification":{"payload":"tree aa401b80bc203e54d8393451b773b27c7a4b2eaf\nparent 1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787046814 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787046814 +0800\n\nfeat: split microfrontend plugins by framework + systemjs dep extraction\n\nEach entry-HTML microfrontend framework now has its own plugin instead\nof one umbrella QiankunPlugin:\n\n- QiankunPlugin: qiankun registerMicroApps entry / vite-plugin-qiankun\n  proEntry\n- GarfishPlugin: Garfish.run apps[].entry\n- MicroAppPlugin: microApp.start({url})\n- WujiePlugin: startApp({url})\n- IcestarkPlugin: AppRoute url (string and array forms)\n- microapp_helpers.go: shared entry validation / context guard / resolve\n\nAlso add unconditional System.register([''./dep.js'', ...]) dep-array\nextraction to UniversalURLPlugin (single-spa / rollup system-format\nbundles), which was previously shadowed by the seen-set gate.\n\nHarness verdicts (dj_demo) before -> after:\n  single-spa  12x FAIL -> 12x PASS\n  micro-app    8x FAIL ->  8x PASS\n  icestark    11x FAIL -> 11x PASS\n  wujie        3x FAIL ->  3x PASS\n  garfish     10x PASS -> 10x PASS (no regression, now via GarfishPlugin)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJwvkS5Co74XpN6LEf4P2+NTgL5hdpmKNYq5b3oWquau0xRwEiUZ7ngI88X61X2XHx\nFttq8GVbir7Z0sOZ+zNAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T09:53:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/e26156144250639917f7df13734583ff04a0410c","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGUyNjE1NjE0NDI1MDYzOTkxN2Y3ZGYxMzczNDU4M2ZmMDRhMDQxMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e","sha":"1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e"}],"sha":"e26156144250639917f7df13734583ff04a0410c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/