","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGEEdGG+TWCFNf9/xeptsbUbyc3KwjsrKOgyCblt0ZyTl2eMJx/seB3Ht2kVN3cHQH\ntj2Ray4MSL4SrH9R0DCwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T07:53:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDE0ODM1OTQ0MDAwNDFhNjUyMzI0OTJlOTZiM2MyODNmODcxMGEyMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/88541d3d3ba869e3173d750e36ead3c31894db89","sha":"88541d3d3ba869e3173d750e36ead3c31894db89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/88541d3d3ba869e3173d750e36ead3c31894db89"}],"sha":"1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/1483594400041a65232492e96b3c283f8710a20e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/88541d3d3ba869e3173d750e36ead3c31894db89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:48:22Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:48:22Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: add QiankunPlugin for single-spa microfrontend apps\n\nSites built with qiankun (including vite-plugin-qiankun) or entry-HTML\nstyle single-spa microfrontends embed app registrations like:\n\n  {name:\"business\", proEntry:\"/aio/app/business/\", container:\"#micro-container\"}\n\ndj previously ignored these entry directory URLs (not .js), so only the\nmain SPA bundle was discovered. The new plugin:\n\n- extracts entry/proEntry values pointing to sub-app HTML entry\n  (directory path or index.html; skips dev //ip:port addresses and\n  template variables)\n- requires nearby microfrontend context (container/activeRule/\n  activeWhen/sandbox/singular) to avoid false positives\n- enqueues them as HTML intermediates; existing plugins then extract\n  sub-app <script src>, modulepreload/prefetch links and inline\n  import(''/app/js/xxx.js'') calls\n\nVerified on a qiankun site: 3 JS -> 748 JS (329 business + 415\ninfrastructure sub-app JS), sampled URLs all reachable. No regression\non Vite/Webpack test sites.","tree":{"sha":"ecb3973dedf6c5878698e935bc396dc4e20934f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/ecb3973dedf6c5878698e935bc396dc4e20934f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/88541d3d3ba869e3173d750e36ead3c31894db89","verification":{"payload":"tree ecb3973dedf6c5878698e935bc396dc4e20934f1\nparent fa956df21bba9a74bf6d06560d2cf4c9ad33b9ea\nauthor ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1786952902 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1786952902 +0800\n\nfeat: add QiankunPlugin for single-spa microfrontend apps\n\nSites built with qiankun (including vite-plugin-qiankun) or entry-HTML\nstyle single-spa microfrontends embed app registrations like:\n\n  {name:\"business\", proEntry:\"/aio/app/business/\", container:\"#micro-container\"}\n\ndj previously ignored these entry directory URLs (not .js), so only the\nmain SPA bundle was discovered. The new plugin:\n\n- extracts entry/proEntry values pointing to sub-app HTML entry\n  (directory path or index.html; skips dev //ip:port addresses and\n  template variables)\n- requires nearby microfrontend context (container/activeRule/\n  activeWhen/sandbox/singular) to avoid false positives\n- enqueues them as HTML intermediates; existing plugins then extract\n  sub-app <script src>, modulepreload/prefetch links and inline\n  import(''/app/js/xxx.js'') calls\n\nVerified on a qiankun site: 3 JS -> 748 JS (329 business + 415\ninfrastructure sub-app JS), sampled URLs all reachable. No regression\non Vite/Webpack test sites.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgS5joz/txa9gCHDmkRjODQR26Zj\nxLefxTaIQIownpJgQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAwEgWgTNAVB3GKjnn1BrFuQkkpnF5fPQIlOsoSyRAU4