users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/938b4eec606c9f2f325ae04cb0fbde30d05e3dba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:02:46Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:02:46Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"fix: capture <link rel=prefetch href> chunks (Vite/Webpack5 prod build)\n\nThe HTMLScriptPlugin previously only recognized <link rel=\"modulepreload\">,\nmissing the production-build standard <link rel=\"prefetch\"> used by\nVue 3 / Vite to mark all async chunks for browser prefetching.\n\nThis caused sites like the 122.224.35.132:10800 Keqiao enrollment portal\n(Vue 3 / Vite production build) to return only 4 JS instead of ~63.\n\nChanges (only pkg/plugins/html_script.go):\n- Add prefetchRe field (order-insensitive, .js suffix required)\n- Add independent extraction loop (no impact on existing modulepreload path)\n- modulePreloadRe and its extraction loop are completely untouched\n\nVerified:\n- 122.224.35.132:10800: 4 -> 63 JS\n- nuxt.com.cn: 162 -> 162 (unchanged)\n- docs.qq.com: 3638 -> 3633 (within network noise)","tree":{"sha":"54fac415847cf53be92241aa7a25104d39d2af38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/54fac415847cf53be92241aa7a25104d39d2af38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/938b4eec606c9f2f325ae04cb0fbde30d05e3dba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/938b4eec606c9f2f325ae04cb0fbde30d05e3dba","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDkzOGI0ZWVjNjA2YzlmMmYzMjVhZTA0Y2IwZmJkZTMwZDA1ZTNkYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/5356714d6712ad07a013e5c21472e299b80ef153","sha":"5356714d6712ad07a013e5c21472e299b80ef153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/5356714d6712ad07a013e5c21472e299b80ef153"}],"sha":"938b4eec606c9f2f325ae04cb0fbde30d05e3dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/938b4eec606c9f2f325ae04cb0fbde30d05e3dba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/5356714d6712ad07a013e5c21472e299b80ef153/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:30:37Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:30:37Z","email":"ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: add universal URL extraction (encoding-aware fallback) + webpack 4 HASH.TIMESTAMP pattern\n\n新增功能:\n- 新增 UniversalURLPlugin: 通用 JS URL 提取（兜底）\n  * 先用 extractor.DecodeContent 做编码还原\n  * 再用宽松正则匹配 <script src>、import()、require()、裸 .js 字符串\n  * 用于覆盖 document.write 内嵌脚本、自定义 loader 等现有插件未识别的场景\n- 新增 pkg/extractor/decode.go: 集中编码还原逻辑\n  * URL 编码 (%xx) / JS 字符串字面量转义 (\\/, \\\", ...) / Unicode 转义 (\\uXXXX) / HTML 实体 (&lt;, &#x2F;)\n  * 快速路径: 不含编码特征时零开销返回原字符串\n\nWebpackPlugin 增强:\n- 新增 webpack 4 双段指纹 (HASH.TIMESTAMP) 模式识别\n  * 提取 l.p+''''+({}[n=k]||n)+''.HASH.TIMESTAMP.js'' 形式\n  * 支持 {\"chunk-xxx\":1} 存在性标记\n  * 支持 {\"chunk-xxx\":\"HASH.TIMESTAMP\"} 完整映射\n  * 跨 JS 共享 runtime 指纹（HTML inline 解析后 app.js 复用）\n\nPipeline 优化:\n- 抽取 processResults 与 processInlineResults 的重复 ProbeTarget 处理逻辑\n  到 dispatchProbeTarget() 公共函数,保证两路径行为一致\n- 修复 processFragment 路径上的 URL 重复处理 bug（新增 IsSeenURL 去重）\n- 修复跨域 URL 缓存文件名冲突（用 URL 自身 host 而非 baseURL host）\n\n兼容性:\n- 现有 16 个插件未动一行，新增逻辑全部隔离在末尾块\n- go test + go vet 全部通过\n\nREADME:\n- 插件数 16 -> 17,新增 UniversalURLPlugin 条目\n- 补充 WebpackPlugin 描述（HASH.TIMESTAMP 指纹 + 存在性标记）","tree":{"sha":"4579f72e9a55b0884dd235630d767b52b5ee3c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/4579f72e9a55b0884dd235630d767b52b5ee3c64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/comm