gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/172d46622b3214eaac0f0c1b84f13602ff4b4ede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:05:22Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:05:22Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: restore original source code from source maps with cache reuse\n\n- Add pkg/sourcemap package: parse source map v3, restore original source\n  files from sourcesContent (priority) with mappings VLQ fallback\n- Restore sources preserve original directory structure under sources/\n- Support external .map files, inline data URIs, and HEAD-probed maps\n- Cache reuse: second run restores from meta.json with zero network requests\n  (skip restore if source files already on disk)\n- Enhance meta.json: cache_dirs, sources_restored, restored_source_count,\n  restored_sources (relative paths), from_plugin on all entries\n- All local paths in meta.json are relative to cache root\n- Output formats: text summary, markdown status, JSON with sourceCount\n- Path security: stack-based .. traversal prevention, depth/length limits\n- Update README (en/zh) with new features and cache structure","tree":{"sha":"48f6f569687be9fcc8cdce23827863a444934b55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/48f6f569687be9fcc8cdce23827863a44493