_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/f4e394eded27d180dd9d260b917b6358a9819290/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:08:11Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:08:11Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: support non-ASCII User-Agent strings\n\nSome sites gate responses on UA charset (e.g., example.com requires\nthe Chinese string \"custom UA string\"). Go''s http.Header.Set enforces\nASCII, so write the value directly to the header map to bypass that\nvalidation when the value contains non-ASCII characters. ASCII\nvalues still use Header.Set for the standard path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9916a488dd56230f7a241e22191b7ac648a5421c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/9916a488dd56230f7a241e22191b7ac648a5421c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/f4e394eded27d180dd9d260b917b6358a9819290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/f4e394eded27d180dd9d260b917b6358a9819290","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGY0ZTM5NGVkZWQyN2QxODBkZDlkMjYwYjkxN2I2MzU4YTk4MTkyOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67","sha":"3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67"}],"sha":"f4e394eded27d180dd9d260b917b6358a9819290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/f4e394eded27d180dd9d260b917b6358a9819290"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T12:14:38Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T12:14:38Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: robust arg parsing, help examples, ASCII-only UA, cache nil fix\n\nArgument parser:\n- Support both --flag=value and --flag value for all options\n- Support short alias --ua for --useragent\n- Validate --cache values (true/false/1/0/yes/no/on/off)\n- Position-independent URL (works before or after any flags)\n- Reject unknown flags explicitly instead of silently treating as URL\n\nHelp output:\n- Examples section with common invocations\n- Notes clarifying flag-value forms and URL positioning\n- Single source of truth (printHelp) for both -h and missing-URL errors\n\nSafety:\n- Reject non-ASCII --useragent values (HTTP headers must be ASCII)\n  and fall back to default rather than letting Go''s http transport\n  refuse the request\n\nOutput:\n- formatMD no longer panics when CacheDirs is nil (--cache=false case)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d04ba15bbe88f9d1e20e3c68218c150d972c6eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/d04ba15bbe88f9d1e20e3c68218c150d972c6eed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKDMzOTNlOGVmN2ZhYWQxYjRiYzdhZWM2Y2EyNjc0NDRmNjIxOGZhNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d","sha":"d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d"}],"sha":"3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/3393e8ef7faad1b4bc7aec6ca267444f6218fa67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T08:54:43Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T08:54:43Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"fix: align displayed cache directory path with actual path\n\nThe output reported a cache directory like\n`/tmp/ejfkdev/dj/https_example.com-yspt-api/js` (dashes from\nextractHost), but the real on-disk path used underscores from\nNormalizeOrigin. Switch the display path to use NormalizeOrigin so\nthe reported path actually exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91d04e8938dc9743b511a62689f6b0feba824dbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/91d04e8938dc9743b511a62689f6b0feba824dbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGQ4N2QwYWRmOGZhZjRlMjAxMDc0Njg2ZDg4MGM1MzAwMTczMzhiNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/d2ef3597a5756bbb0e0d02cf35b275e6a08b5381","sha":"d2ef3597a5756bbb0e0d02cf35b275e6a08b5381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/d2ef3597a5756bbb0e0d02cf35b275e6a08b5381"}],"sha":"d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/d87d0adf8faf4e201074686d880c530017338b4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/d2ef3597a5756bbb0e0d02cf35b275e6a08b5381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T15:40:56Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T15:40:56Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: Next.js RSC Flight probing and Turbopack support\n\nAdd RSC (React Server Components) probing to discover JS chunks that\nare only loaded server-side. Send RSC:1 header to Next.js pages,\nparse Flight protocol I[] chunk mappings and :HL preload hints,\nand recursively discover routes for further RSC probing.\n\nKey changes:\n- Fetcher: add FetchWithHeaders for RSC requests\n- Interface: add ContentTypeFlight and RSCProbe types\n- NextJSPlugin: parse inline __next_f data, RSC flight responses,\n  HTML <a href> links for route discovery, and _buildManifest.js\n- Pipeline: process RSCProbes with rsc: prefix dedup\n- Fix chunkPathRe to match Turbopack immutable paths\n\nResults: nextjs.org 36→47 JS (+31%)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ab0ae78ac97e433c72baae3c4d7d82d34072ff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/0ab0ae78ac97e433c72baae3c4d7d82d34072ff3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/d2ef3597a5756bbb0e0d02cf35b275e6a08b5381","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ab0ae78ac97e433c72baae3c4d7d82d34072ff3\nparent f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1780242056 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1780242056 +0800\n\nfeat: Next.js RSC Flight probing and Turbopack support\n\nAdd RSC (React Server Components) probing to discover JS chunks that\nare only loaded server-side. Send RSC:1 header to Next.js pages,\nparse Flight protocol I[] chunk mappings and :HL preload hints,\nand recursively discover routes for further RSC probing.\n\nKey changes:\n- Fetcher: add FetchWithHeaders for RSC requests\n- Interface: add ContentTypeFlight and RSCProbe types\n- NextJSPlugin: parse inline __next_f data, RSC flight responses,\n  HTML <a href> links for route discovery, and _buildManifest.js\n- Pipeline: process RSCProbes with rsc: prefix dedup\n- Fix chunkPathRe to match Turbopack immutable paths\n\nResults: nextjs.org 36→47 JS (+31%)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATUR