jfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T14:22:36Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T14:22:36Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: SOCKS5/HTTPS proxy, NO_PROXY, Windows path safety, and env var proxy support\n\n- Add SOCKS5 proxy support (socks5://, socks5h://) with authentication\n- Add HTTPS proxy support (TLS to proxy + CONNECT tunnel)\n- Add environment variable proxy support: ALL_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY, HTTP_PROXY\n- Add NO_PROXY support with domain suffix matching (.example.com)\n- CLI --proxy flag takes priority over environment variables\n- Auto-add http:// scheme when proxy URL has no scheme\n- Fix Windows path safety: sanitize colons and reserved chars in cache paths\n- Refactor proxy dialing into per-request resolveProxy with NO_PROXY check\n- Extract sendConnectRequest as shared helper for HTTP/HTTPS proxies\n- Update README with proxy types and environment variable examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8de972b1f11110f4d74f98c7ec02b53b43aeadee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/8de972b1f11110f4d74f98c7ec02b53b43aeadee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30","verification":{"payload":"tree 8de972b1f11110f4d74f98c7ec02b53b43aeadee\nparent 9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1777990956 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1777990956 +0800\n\nfeat: SOCKS5/HTTPS proxy, NO_PROXY, Windows path safety, and env var proxy support\n\n- Add SOCKS5 proxy support (socks5://, socks5h://) with authentication\n- Add HTTPS proxy support (TLS to proxy + CONNECT tunnel)\n- Add environment variable proxy support: ALL_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY, HTTP_PROXY\n- Add NO_PROXY support with domain suffix matching (.example.com)\n- CLI --proxy flag takes priority over environment variables\n- Auto-add http:// scheme when proxy URL has no scheme\n- Fix Windows path safety: sanitize colons and reserved chars in cache paths\n- Refactor proxy dialing into per-request resolveProxy with NO_PROXY check\n- Extract sendConnectRequest as shared helper for HTTP/HTTPS proxies\n- Update README with proxy types and environment variable examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQSzZuP+lR9EaAzmx/sBev8UrKHt7AUCafn9LRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQAXr/FKyh7eze+wEAj4sbhorHXhTD2sgLOmCg\nc+ZoRj3ZilbQjpMILE7ek10BAOU3rrqyZZ/kI20VlDIm4rOq9W+QpDgQ/hDjqL54\n4J0M\n=Niml\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-05T14:23:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30","node_id":"C_kwDOR5ftYdoAKGY5OGZlNDRmNGNjMmNlN2ZmMjFlMmFiNWZhZTAwYTUxM2RkZDhmMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev/dj/commit/9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5","sha":"9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5"}],"sha":"f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/f98fe44f4cc2ce7ff21e2ab5fae00a513ddd8f30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/commits/9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T07:57:46Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T07:57:46Z","email":"152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ejfkdev"},"message":"feat: add uTLS fingerprint spoofing, cookie jar, and brotli support\n\n- Use uTLS (HelloChrome_Auto) to mimic Chrome TLS fingerprint,\n  bypassing Cloudflare JA3 detection without browser integration\n- Force HTTP/1.1 ALPN to avoid HTTP/2 incompatibility with\n  custom DialTLSContext\n- Add cookie jar (net/http/cookiejar) for persisting cookies\n  between requests (e.g., cf_clearance)\n- Add --cookie flag for manual cookie injection\n- Add SetCookies/SetBrowserCookies methods to Fetcher/Pipeline\n- Fix brotli decompression (was a no-op, now uses andybalholm/brotli)\n- Remove bot-identifying \"dj/{version}\" from default User-Agent\n- Proxy CONNECT tunnel with byte-by-byte response reading to\n  avoid bufio buffering TLS handshake data\n- Support proxy from both --proxy flag and HTTPS_PROXY env var\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d2c89a7678fa0677e3ecff6a760207191a7180c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/2d2c89a7678fa0677e3ecff6a760207191a7180c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/9702edd667d62eff90fbfdc3f81d4b7b013595b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d2c89a7678fa0677e3ecff6a760207191a7180c\nparent f9d5a4542384550785960f58d3fdb11e35ed723c\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1777967866 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1777967866 +0800\n\nfeat: add uTLS fingerprint spoofing, cookie jar, and brotli support\n\n- Use uTLS (HelloChrome_Auto) to mimic Chrome TLS fingerprint,\n  bypassing Cloudflare JA3 detection without browser integration\n- Force HTTP/1.1 ALPN to avoid HTTP/2 incompatibility with\n  custom DialTLSContext\n- Add cookie jar (net/http/cookiejar) for persisting cookies\n  between requests (e.g., cf_clearance)\n- Add --cookie flag for manual cookie injection\n- Add SetCookies/SetBrowserCookies methods to Fetcher/Pipeline\n- Fix brotli decompression (was a no-op, now uses andybalholm/brotli)\n- Remove bot-identifying \"dj/{version}\" from default User-Agent\n- Proxy CONNECT tunnel with byte-by-byte response reading to\n  avoid bufio buffering TLS handshake data\n- Support proxy from both --proxy flag and HTTPS_PROXY env var\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQSzZuP+lR9EaAzmx/sBev8UrKHt7AUCafmi+hsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQAXr/FKyh7ewyDgD+Ieh0+H1aSv2HtkCWArOG\nHWBYT6Oxz7fTsPmgLANqkbUA/36qlRKljensN1QhrrY40eQLevOZMBp6wD63Sjm6\nMboF\n=dKpF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-05T08:01:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.c