64, only skip darwin and windows/arm64.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ecbee34131516e97ab247a338d5ccf625ec036e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/trees/4ecbee34131516e97ab247a338d5ccf625ec036e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ejfkdev/dj/git/commits/f9d5a4542384550785960f58d3fdb11e35ed723c","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ecbee34131516e97ab247a338d5ccf625ec036e\nparent 81833cfdb2fee28298eb91ba8dbf752effdaedc5\nauthor ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1776959389 +0800\ncommitter ejfkdev <152914458+ejfkdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1776959389 +0800\n\nfix: enable UPX compression for windows/amd64 in CI\n\nUPX supports windows/amd64, only skip darwin and windows/arm64.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQSzZuP+lR9EaAzmx/sBev8UrKHt7AUCaeo/nRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQAXr/FKyh7ey+TgD+LszfU6xvN7lP7Ssf/Bw0\n48hqvzw2hTIQp9CgZx50Dv8A/jFaW2bt2MtHscv74ZmyQamjnR10HSX30sxj5vRr\nahYB\n=OfE3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T15:49:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152914458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ejfkdev","id":152914458,"login":"ejfkdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCR1KGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ejfkdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/