","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dhrv9023","id":262603308,"login":"dhrv9023","node_id":"U_kgDOD6cCLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhrv9023/prsnl/commits/95667527579aac340c5a35bfcefd85ee184e3b4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T05:50:55Z","email":"dhrv9023@gmail.com","name":"dhrv9023"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T05:50:55Z","email":"dhrv9023@gmail.com","name":"dhrv9023"},"message":"fix: switch LLM to groq/compound-mini — fixes all AI features\n\n- PRIMARY ISSUE: openai/gpt-oss-20b returns HTTP 400 json_validate_failed\n  on all response_format=json_object requests, breaking every AI feature\n  (deep analysis, hiring intel, cover letter, humanizer, interview)\n\n- Switch GROQ_CHAT_MODEL from broken openai/gpt-oss-20b to groq/compound-mini\n  - Supports response_format={type: json_object} natively\n  - 1-3s latency, 131K context window\n  - 100% free on GroqCloud, no hard OTPM limits on free tier\n\n- Add GROQ_FALLBACK_MODEL=groq/compound\n  - Auto-fallback in chat_complete() when primary fails JSON validation\n  - Higher quality, also free and supports JSON mode\n\n- Add _strip_think_tags() for reasoning model compatibility\n- Add _clean_response() pipeline: think tags + code fences\n\n- Update all docs (8 files) to reflect new model stack