/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhrv9023/prsnl/commits/9be960faa8ea647a7f94c3928eb78cd80f2169c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:00:46Z","email":"dhrv9023@gmail.com","name":"dhrv9023"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:00:46Z","email":"dhrv9023@gmail.com","name":"dhrv9023"},"message":"chore: remove dead code and reorganize misplaced files\n\nDeleted:\n- voice_interview/ — entire folder. Code already lives in\n  backend/app/services/ai_interview.py. This was an old prototype.\n- backend/app/core/request_signing.py — dead code (M-5 from audit).\n  Never imported or called anywhere in the codebase.\n- backend/SUPABASE_MIGRATION_interview_reports.sql — misplaced.\n- FINAL_VALIDATION_SUMMARY.md — internal working doc, not needed.\n- PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT.md — internal working doc, not needed.\n\nMoved:\n- backend/SUPABASE_MIGRATION_interview_reports.sql →\n  supabase/migrations/20260515000002_interview_reports.sql\n  (correct location with proper timestamp prefix)\n\nNot tracked (already gitignored, deleted locally only):\n- AUDIT_REPORT.md\n- code_explained/\n- kareerist_sofar/","tree":{"sha":"43b0cd71a749b8f79a6bbf080b2c681bbc5f264c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhrv9023/prsnl/git/trees/43b0cd71a749b8f79a6bbf080b2c681bbc5f264c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhrv9023/prsnl/git/commits/9be960faa8ea647a7f94c3928eb78cd80f2169c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262603308?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhrv9023/following{/other_use