edge projects (the per-installation\n  lifecycle/config state store edge adapters/comms already expect).\n- dev: emit `[[kv_namespaces]]` in the generated wrangler.toml for any declared\n  `kv`, with a deterministic `local-dev-<binding>` id/preview_id so local\n  Miniflare persists KV between runs.\n\nGuarded by `config.kv` (no effect on projects without KV). Uses the existing\nKvDeclaration type + the deploy handler''s lowercase-binding convention. tsc\nclean, 28 tests pass, verified end-to-end (init scaffold + valid wrangler.toml).\nBumps to 0.10.1.","tree":{"sha":"3dafb18359382f718d8f7d9628f6beae99b25654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/trees/3dafb18359382f718d8f7d9628f6beae99b25654"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/commits/3c60df9c5a844202ef789285500f37cba189d88b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5303454?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DuncanAForbes","id":5303454,"login":"DuncanAForbes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDM0NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commit/3c60df9c5a844202ef789285500f37cba189d88b","node_id":"C_kwDOR55t7NoAKDNjNjBkZjljNWE4NDQyMDJlZjc4OTI4NTUwMGYzN2NiYTE4OWQ4OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commit/d8b1e83b7a8edeed36e49274c58120bfaf87c13c","sha":"d8b1e83b7a8edeed36e49274c58120bfaf87c13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commits/d8b1e83b7a8edeed36e49274c58120bfaf87c13c"}],"sha":"3c60df9c5a844202ef789285500f37cba189d88b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commits/3c60df9c5a844202ef789285500f37cba189d88b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5303454?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DuncanAForbes","id":5303454,"login":"DuncanAForbes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDM0NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commits/d8b1e83b7a8edeed36e49274c58120bfaf87c13c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:27:08Z","email":"daf@duncanforbes.io","name":"DuncanAForbes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:30:56Z","email":"DuncanAForbes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Duncan A Forbes"},"message":"feat: app publisher identity in the manifest + CLI pipeline [BDOK-678]\n\nPhase 2 of app identity (BDOK-678). Adds optional publisher identity to\nbagdock.json and wires it through the CLI. Publisher fields inherit from the\nowning org''s profile by default and override per field, so the existing\nfirst-party apps need no manifest edits.\n\n- config.ts: `BagdockJson` gains `publisher` (company/website/supportEmail/\n  docsUrl/privacyPolicy), `icon` (repo-relative path to a square PNG/SVG), and\n  `description`. Field names follow the BDOK-560 camelCase-manifest convention.\n- validate: dependency-free icon checks (square, PNG/SVG, >=128px, <=256KB via\n  PNG IHDR / SVG width|height|viewBox parsing) + publisher field validation.\n  A public app with no publisher block WARNs (the offline CLI cannot see the org\n  profile that may complete it), never fails.\n- init: inherit-by-default (no publisher block scaffolded); interactive,\n  TTY-gated overrides. New `--yes` skips the prompts for scripted use.\n- deploy: ships `publisher` + `description` in metadata and the icon bytes as an\n  `icon` file part; surfaces the server''s new `publisher_warning`.\n- submit: advisory publisher-completeness pre-check for public apps.\n\nRequires the server-side deploy handler that consumes `metadata.publisher` and\nthe `icon` part (ships first). Bumps to 0.10.0.","tree":{"sha":"5bb55e2a67cd2a8936c909ad3711aab14647c050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/trees/5bb55e2a67cd2a8936c909ad3711aab14647c050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/commits/d8b1e83b7a8edeed36e49274c58120bfaf87c13c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5303454?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"