.yml fires on both push-to-main and the v* tag, and the team also\ncuts GitHub releases — so a single version can trigger publish twice. The\nduplicate run failed with ''cannot publish over the previously published\nversion''. Add a version-existence check that gates the publish step so the\nredundant run goes green (skips) instead of red.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b510315071cdfe8978153e0336de96a39301b95b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/trees/b510315071cdfe8978153e0336de96a39301b95b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/commits/1c85bd111b106f4dce163d0fd0ddaa6a058f185d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5303454?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DuncanAForbes","id":5303454,"login":"DuncanAForbes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDM0NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commit/1c85bd111b106f4dce163d0fd0ddaa6a058f185d","node_id":"C_kwDOR55t7NoAKDFjODViZDExMWIxMDZmNGRjZTE2M2QwZmQwZGRhYTZhMDU4ZjE4NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https: