//api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuncanAForbes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/commits/47873a0437ee62b3ad2b195bdfcf5f080f21b727/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-06T19:57:25Z","email":"DuncanAForbes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Duncan A Forbes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-06T19:57:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"v0.6.0: add --ngrok flag for local tunnel environments (#7)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add `--ngrok` global flag that reads `BAGDOCK_API_URL` /\n`BAGDOCK_DASHBOARD_URL` from a `.env.local` file, allowing developers to\npoint the CLI at local ngrok tunnels\n- Convert `API_BASE` / `DASHBOARD_BASE` from constants to mutable\ngetters (`getApiBase()` / `getDashboardBase()`)\n- Update all files that referenced the old constants: `auth.ts`,\n`api.ts`, `open.ts`, `deploy.ts`, `submit.ts`\n- Pin `@types/bun` from `\"latest\"` to `\"^1.3.10\"`\n- Bump version to `0.6.0`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `bagdock login --ngrok` reads `.env.local` and uses the custom API\nURL\n- [ ] Without `--ngrok`, commands use the default\n`https://api.bagdock.com`\n- [ ] Missing `.env.local` shows a helpful error message\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added `--ngrok` command-line option for enhanced configuration\nflexibility.\n* Introduced support for local environment configuration via\n`.env.local` file, enabling runtime API and dashboard URL customisation.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated CLI version to 0.6.0.\n  * Pinned development dependency version for improved type consistency.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"0cce242335b9151df19cd5b9c7fcfe390385ef16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bagdock/bagdock-cli/git/trees/0cce242335b9151df19cd5b9c7fcf