"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7ac8aec84210fdb02b8715af3ec6c06a42870608"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/bb3ace34f46b8a9e97bf7b051b7fee4d331fe647/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:24:51Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"test(runtime): stage the readiness races with a controllable probe\n\nThe previous readiness tests passed whether or not the resolver-ownership\nguard was present: against a live runtime detection returns in\nmilliseconds, so the window the guard protects had already closed before\nstop() ran.\n\nRoute detectRuntime through an overridable slot, mirroring\n_setCurrentHostIdsForTesting, so a test can park detection and stage the\nreal sequence — start A parks, start B parks, A completes late, stop()\nsettles B. Verified to fail without the ownership check and pass with it.","tree":{"sha":"3c3ba31a23ce19dbc5f54177dcb078d3c28548fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/3c3ba31a23ce19dbc5f54177dcb078d3c28548fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/bb3ace34f46b8a9e97bf7b051b7fee4d331fe647","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/bb3ace34f46b8a9e97bf7b051b7fee4d331fe647","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGJiM2FjZTM0ZjQ2YjhhOWU5N2JmN2IwNTFiN2ZlZTRkMzMxZmU2NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a","sha":"7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a"}],"sha":"bb3ace34f46b8a9e97bf7b051b7fee4d331fe647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/bb3ace34f46b8a9e97bf7b051b7fee4d331fe647"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:05:34Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): keep a stale resolver from clearing a newer start''s\n\nHoisting the readiness resolver to plugin scope made the slot shared, and\nthe per-start closure cleared it unconditionally. A start whose detection\nreturned after a successor had begun would null the successor''s resolver,\nso a later stop() found nothing to settle and that start''s whenReady()\nstayed pending.\n\nClear the slot only while it still holds our own resolver, mirroring the\nownership check the retry timer already carries.","tree":{"sha":"aac19e542a6fa4dc95d5caf87e767172667eee85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/aac19e542a6fa4dc95d5caf87e767172667eee85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDdjY2ZkYzZkMmNkMmI0NzE3MzYxMDRjY2Y5YTZiNjk1ZjViNDE5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db","sha":"7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db"}],"sha":"7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7ccfdc6d2cd2b471736104ccf9a6b695f5b4197a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:55:41Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): settle whenReady() when stop() cancels a pending detection\n\nThe readiness resolver was a per-start local, so stop() could not reach\nit. The generation guards resolve on every path they take, but only once\nthe awaited call returns — a socket connect that never settles left\nwhenReady() pending for good, and a consumer awaiting it blocked\nindefinitely.\n\nHold the resolver in plugin-scope state and settle it from stop(), and\nfrom start() before it installs a successor so a consumer still holding\nthe previous promise is released rather than stranded.","tree":{"sha":"ac36394491d31dacc6a5fcdd0c2f39b6e6cb8b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/ac36394491d31dacc6a5fcdd0c2f39b6e6cb8b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDdmMjUxNmVjZTk5ZDI0ODFjZDFmMDg1MTdjNzNiOWViNmM0MGI0ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a","sha":"5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a"}],"sha":"7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/7f2516ece99d2481cd1f08517c73b9eb6c40b4db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:43:11Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): retire the previous start when start() re-enters\n\nOnly stop() bumped the detection generation, so a start() that re-entered\nwithout an intervening stop() shared the prior one. The earlier run''s\nin-flight detection then passed every guard and could overwrite the new\nrun''s runtimeInfo and prune scheduler, and its retry callback could null a\ntimer the newer start had just installed.\n\nBump the generation and cancel any pending re-probe at the top of start(),\nmirroring stop(), and let a retry callback clear the timer handle only\nwhile it still owns it.","tree":{"sha":"484baac6d687c6a084a439db201086850e1984d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/484baac6d687c6a084a439db201086850e1984d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDU1MTQ0OThhNmZlZDFhMjc4YzZlMDhiYWM1NmYwZmZlNjE5MDUzMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990","sha":"0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990"}],"sha":"5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/5514498a6fed1a278c6e08bac56f0ffe6190530a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:34:36Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"style: apply prettier to files the formatter had drifted from\n\nThese seven files predate a prettier bump and were never reformatted, so\n`prettier --check .` failed on a clean master and would have shown red on\nany PR regardless of its contents. Pure formatter output — line rewrapping\nonly, no semantic change.","tree":{"sha":"15f94124b6c43a4320f0361960fb050e415b2535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/15f94124b6c43a4320f0361960fb050e415b2535"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDA4ODdkNjMwMmEwNDY1OGZmYTE3NTA0NjRjNWQxNTM1YjI5ODE5OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81","sha":"b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81"}],"sha":"0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/0887d6302a04658ffa1750464c5d1535b2981990"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:34:36Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): ignore a startup rejection that arrives after stop\n\nThe generation token lived inside the async init IIFE, so its rejection\nhandler could not see it. A startup step that rejected after stop() still\ncalled setPluginError on a torn-down plugin, leaving an error on the\ndashboard that nothing would ever clear.\n\nHoist the capture above the IIFE so both it and the handler share one\ntoken, and skip the error surfacing when the instance is gone. Readiness\nstill settles, so a consumer holding that start''s promise is released\neither way.","tree":{"sha":"b56feb42a0e2caa48834b28ad7daca4b58093aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/b56feb42a0e2caa48834b28ad7daca4b58093aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGIwODI0ZDI5YzU0YzhjOTM3NmEyOGVmZGUyNzkyM2E5YjZlZTBmODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af","sha":"ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af"}],"sha":"b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/b0824d29c54c8c9376a28efde27923a9b6ee0f81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:04:01Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(client): let only genuine absence outrank a denied socket\n\nThe first cut suppressed the permission fallback whenever any\nhigher-priority candidate was passed over — including a stale plain file,\nan unreadable parent directory, or a socket whose daemon is dead. On\nthose hosts the operator lost an actionable group_add remediation and got\na no-runtime status that the new re-probe would poll indefinitely.\n\nNarrow the rule to ENOENT, the one case the boot race actually needs: the\npreferred socket has not been created yet. Every other failure leaves the\ndenial as the most useful thing detection knows.","tree":{"sha":"876103fe0450fa3b7f5da5aedd504b3ec78c257e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/876103fe0450fa3b7f5da5aedd504b3ec78c257e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGFjMTM2MGFhMjI1YTVjMDBjYTI2YWMyN2I0ZjI4NmJjYWM2NzAzYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84","sha":"d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84"}],"sha":"ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/ac1360aa225a5c00ca26ac27b4f286bcac6703af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:55:50Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): settle readiness when a stop cancels detection\n\nThe generation guards returned before localResolveReady(), so a stop()\nlanding inside the initial detectRuntime() or selfDeployment() await left\nthat start''s whenReady() promise pending forever — a consumer awaiting it\nwould hang rather than see a plugin that had shut down.\n\nResolve the captured resolver on those paths too. Each start reassigns\nreadyPromise with its own resolver, so settling a stopped instance''s\npromise cannot reach a later start''s.","tree":{"sha":"785b6b3f1aa9f375b04904693602983c1bbe3851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/785b6b3f1aa9f375b04904693602983c1bbe3851"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGQ2YWQ2MDE2NGE5MWViZTU3NDQ4MTMyNzBiZWU2MGU1NzhkOThlODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe","sha":"f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe"}],"sha":"d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/d6ad60164a91ebe5744813270bee60e578d98e84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:49:08Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): guard initial detection against a concurrent stop\n\nThe generation token covered the re-probe path but not the startup that\nlaunches it. `plugin.start()` does not await its own async init, so a\nstop() can land inside the initial detectRuntime() or selfDeployment()\nawait — and the continuation then assigned runtimeInfo and scheduled a\nretry that captured the already-incremented generation, so every\ndownstream guard read the stopped instance as current.\n\nCapture the generation before the first await and recheck it after each,\nassigning runtimeInfo only once the instance is known to still be\nrunning.","tree":{"sha":"f249ab24c1a8ad33fc795c372f13e999da36a525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/f249ab24c1a8ad33fc795c372f13e999da36a525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGYyN2YzYjAxZmE2Yjc0YjFhM2M4N2FiNjE2N2Y4NzkzZTM2MWVjYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016","sha":"9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016"}],"sha":"f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/f27f3b01fa6b74b1a3c87ab6167f8793e361ecbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:44:07Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): drop a re-probe that outlived the plugin\n\nclearTimeout cannot reach a re-probe that has already fired and is\nsitting in `await detectRuntime(...)`. A stop() landing in that window\nleft the callback free to assign runtimeInfo and run the post-detection\npath, which starts a PruneScheduler — reviving state stop() had just\ntorn down.\n\nCarry a start generation, bumped by stop(), and recheck it after every\nawait in the retry and in the post-detection path before either surfaces\na status or starts the scheduler.","tree":{"sha":"544830480afb172e798d3fe0dc447a11fad8af83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/544830480afb172e798d3fe0dc447a11fad8af83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDlmY2VhNGQ0ZTZjZTBlMTViYTMyMTFkMmM0ZDA0NDZhZTI1NzIwMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc","sha":"93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc"}],"sha":"9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/9fcea4d4e6ce0e15ba3211d2c4d0446ae2572016"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:31:32Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(runtime): re-probe for a runtime that appears after startup\n\nSignal K can start before the container runtime socket exists, and\ndetection ran exactly once. A rootless podman socket is socket-activated\nunder the user''s systemd instance, so a server started from a system unit\n— what `npm i -g signalk-server` installs, with no ordering directives at\nall — routinely probes before user@<uid>.service has brought the socket\nup. The plugin then stayed dead until someone restarted Signal K.\n\nRe-probe on a doubling backoff, holding at a minute, for as long as the\nfailure stays retryable: no-runtime and socket-unreachable both mean\nnothing usable answered yet and that this can change on its own.\npermission-denied is excluded — a socket answered and refused us, which\nan operator fixes, and polling it would replace a clear error with a loop\nthat never converges.\n\nwhenReady() still resolves on the first attempt, so consumers never block\nwaiting for a host to gain a runtime; they read getRuntime(), which stays\nnull until a re-probe wins.","tree":{"sha":"6c23073e97ce99e088af038e0e9b6290538f3c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/6c23073e97ce99e088af038e0e9b6290538f3c43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDkzZWMyMDk4NDgxYjdlMGE3OThiMzIxZDE3MGJmNzI1YTdjOTBmYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912","sha":"b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912"}],"sha":"93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/93ec2098481b7e0a798b321d170bf725a7c90fbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:31:19Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:52:28Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(client): keep a denied socket from outranking an absent one\n\n`pickSocket` remembered the first socket that existed but refused us, and\nreturned it when nothing else answered. That is right when the denial\noutranks every other candidate, but a rootless host at boot inverts it:\nthe preferred /run/user/<uid>/podman/podman.sock is socket-activated and\nnot up yet, while /run/podman/podman.sock sits behind a 0700 root:root\ndirectory whose stat raises EACCES. The rootful denial won, and\nresolveClient cached it for the process lifetime — so the plugin reported\npermission-denied until someone restarted Signal K by hand.\n\nReturn a denial only when no higher-priority candidate was passed over\nfor some other reason. The containerized-Docker group_add case is\nunchanged: there the preferred socket is genuinely absent and the\nbind-mounted one is the only candidate.","tree":{"sha":"63c7c7ead91e706bcb67ffa6a4af465afd24b417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/63c7c7ead91e706bcb67ffa6a4af465afd24b417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/b3b4e8cc0cf0ede0258758db768205892f3d0912","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKGIzYjRlOGNjMGNmMGVkZTAyNTg3NThkYjc2ODIwNTg5MmYzZDA5MTI","parents":[{"html_url":