eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/942748806687041e2d3355119d3c8e36fe5a7594","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDk0Mjc0ODgwNjY4NzA0MWUyZDMzNTUxMTlkM2M4ZTM2ZmU1YTc1OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/475252f7da0ba390dd80626f2915eb59c57bf0a7","sha":"475252f7da0ba390dd80626f2915eb59c57bf0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/475252f7da0ba390dd80626f2915eb59c57bf0a7"}],"sha":"942748806687041e2d3355119d3c8e36fe5a7594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/942748806687041e2d3355119d3c8e36fe5a7594"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/475252f7da0ba390dd80626f2915eb59c57bf0a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:17:13Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:39:30Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(test): skip the EACCES fallback tests as root\n\nThe plugin registry scores signalk-container 70 instead of 100 because\n`own_tests_pass` is false. The tests are fine; its harness runs them as root.\n\nThree `removeManagedData` tests force EACCES with `chmod 0o555` on a parent\ndirectory. Root ignores directory permission bits, so `fs.rm` succeeds, the\nfallback under test never triggers, and they fail with \"Missing expected\nrejection\". Measured:\n\n  uid 1000 -> rm threw EACCES   (fallback triggers, tests pass)\n  uid 0    -> rm SUCCEEDED      (fallback skipped, tests fail)\n\nA fresh clone of v1.32.1 — what the registry does — installs, builds and\npasses 1329/1329 as an unprivileged user, so nothing was broken.\n\nSkips them where the precondition cannot be created, matching the guard\n`pickSocketPermission.test.ts` already carries for `chmod 0o000` and the same\nreason; its comment even names root sandboxes. Coverage is unchanged for real\nusers: 13 tests run unprivileged, 10 as root.","tree":{"sha":"7d65ff79115fd84910507cfe6d39f304d493c67e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/7d65ff79115fd84910507cfe6d39f304d493c67e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/475252f7da0ba390dd80626f2915eb59c57bf0a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gist