ation suites already use.\n\nA shared guard helper was suggested instead; not taken, because the\ninline guard with the rationale on the declaration is the shape the rest\nof src/test/integration now follows.","tree":{"sha":"f8624fcc9769a16ea23c027526c67266fc752156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/f8624fcc9769a16ea23c027526c67266fc752156"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/891439a5eb6481813803f1a979d7b30d48aa7f4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/891439a5eb6481813803f1a979d7b30d48aa7f4c","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDg5MTQzOWE1ZWI2NDgxODEzODAzZjFhOTc5ZDdiMzBkNDhhYTdmNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90","sha":"36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90"}],"sha":"891439a5eb6481813803f1a979d7b30d48aa7f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/891439a5eb6481813803f1a979d7b30d48aa7f4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:45:35Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:25:57Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"test(volumes): cover the ifMissing policy on a real runtime\n\nThe classifier is unit-tested against an injected probe. What a fixture\ncannot settle is the consequence of getting it wrong, because the two\nruntimes disagree about a bind whose host source is absent. Verified on\na real host, on fresh paths:\n\n  podman  exit 125, the container never starts, nothing is created\n  docker  exit 0, the container starts, and the daemon CREATES the\n          missing host directory\n\nSo \"it will fail loudly at container-create\" holds on one runtime and\nnot the other. On Docker there is no loud failure at all -- just an\nempty directory standing where the required data was meant to be, which\nis why `abort` cannot be given the benefit of the doubt.\n\nCover the three outcomes through `api.ensureRunning`: a source that\nexists is bound, a missing `skip` source is dropped and reported while\nthe container still starts, and a missing `abort` source rejects the\nstart. The last two also assert the host is untouched -- the Docker\ncase would otherwise leave a directory behind.\n\nDriving the API rather than the module-level ensureRunning is load\nbearing: classifyVolumeSources and ownBindMountCoverage are both wired\nin the plugin wrapper, so calling the module function bypasses the\npolicy entirely and mounts the missing source.","tree":{"sha":"e328b4df4cab801f2fe240dd3d91820382e21ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/trees/e328b4df4cab801f2fe240dd3d91820382e21ae7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/git/commits/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90","node_id":"C_kwDOR56yCtoAKDM2ZjE2ZjYzMzdlMTA0ZjAzNTA2ODExMTlmMzZiZjYxMTRlNjhjOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa/signalk-container/commit/56eb7ce4404e82b676597872dec1e2fec757c81d","sha":"56eb7ce4404e82b676597872dec1e2fec757c81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/56eb7ce4404e82b676597872dec1e2fec757c81d"}],"sha":"36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/36f16f6337e104f0350681119f36bf6114e68c90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-container/commits/56eb7ce4404e82b676597872dec1e2fec757c81d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:31:12Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T02:48:51Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.gith