a3dbbc918f4a129f9c15782be5a690bb9ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:13:43Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:13:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(history): refuse a path with more sources than it may expand into (#199)\n\nUnder sourcePolicy=all a path recorded by more than 16 sources returned\nthe first 16 in sorted order and noted the rest in the debug log only,\nso a caller got part of what it asked for without being told. The\nrequest-wide ceiling already fails the request instead; the per-path\none now does the same, naming the count, the ceiling and the way out —\nname the sources with paths=<path>|<sourceRef>, or ask for a shorter\nrange.","tree":{"sha":"216e4b941dae1cbd89ac768265081d86bc93c9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/trees/216e4b941dae1cbd89ac768265081d86bc93c9b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/commits/52f36a3dbbc918f4a129f9c15782be5a690bb9ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 216e4b941dae1cbd89ac768265081d86bc93c9b4\nparent c46db15b75a7338dfab1d5e464bffaf7fe5767d6\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789895623 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789895623 +1200\n\nfix(history): refuse a path with more sources than it may expand into (#199)\n\nUnder sourcePolicy=all a path recorded by more than 16 sources returned\nthe first 16 in sorted order and noted the rest in the debug log only,\nso a caller got part of what it asked for without being told. The\nrequest-wide ceiling already fails the request instead; the per-path\none now does the same, naming the count, the ceiling and the way out —\nname the sources with paths=<path>|<sourceRef>, or ask for a shorter\nrange.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqr6PHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmngQABnhwfSyyGVzFp1IO9UbGb4M\nR5vwioOUnrVIg