an edited title swaps the label; dependencies\nis added for a runtime bump opened by hand and never removed.","tree":{"sha":"5156268ffc8758ab421278c33a46dcec168b32bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/trees/5156268ffc8758ab421278c33a46dcec168b32bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/commits/9760cf6a040be65ffbcfa3879d3ccc85d5a9a9ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 5156268ffc8758ab421278c33a46dcec168b32bc\nparent 606f48881df3df30d585c1735965ce486cfeb8f7\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789861212 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789861212 +1200\n\nci: label a pull request from its title (#194)\n\nrelease.yml sorts the release notes by label, and a pull request opened\nfrom the command line carries none, so every change landed under\n\"Other\". A workflow on pull_request_target reads the title — nothing\nelse, no checkout — and sets the label its conventional-commit type\nmeans: enhancement for feat and perf, bug for fix, skip-changelog for\nci, test, chore, refactor, style and a dev dependency bump. It owns one\nof those at a time, so an edited title swaps the label; dependencies\nis added for a runtime bump opened by hand and never removed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrx1cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyYYQAKRI6Qc0MP5YZh8avEqh47yh\njsmvxZgszeEw8V+zmmrglRPK26t2BVY+6EELaLTrwlLYGaMj4ZcN4MlQn8LOrR7Q\nVxw7OXEEQzIOILotjP1zQAP2WHPZPs4cCrCJ+Pk6g9kT0yABp9fIFWK08oG2TTDb\nvsdRK5dYVP8WGhh2I1RB45UOVj6QvQ8Oqjtk0kLT/PKo/zZBN41O6zeL8hjtgKTl\nycC/4XVoXx3EgDQL/K5/+B7EEggJZule8V9mTxOnFi5PZj166WVaX+uqeSecw3K/\ndrvb7PnznN5N2WImfLzPn4xeoonT4ld6IcmBfR95eky3S6KIIg2cT7aOpN26YnRC\nnRw8FSADJ6UKrYiMt4PXsOzKFEHoRWluW2PIrR1V4NrL93QevE+/5lKT4Qzr70Rm\nl/pL8pSOHBSkJMiC/IkJRh/CikYY+DS/6uZkfZfJyZC/7daP0f8zYMcfpMlvgapc\nOmosIWoHwdrZz1nQnG0ccrLKcpvyYTDrYKCUjGiAuK9+OGrIL0sBYIGT8ED40Rrn\nH1Lnjs3Tn9kxn947Y1EAm31DacPoRQYsBMlb+no9Dvx/aVdXc1ovbveam0zcp3iJ\nKKarO3LA/vmQUuZ