ed on master. The file goes, and release-please\nis told not to keep one.","tree":{"sha":"c0d47f1b1bd6d3a37c750ecc9a27face015d7f61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/trees/c0d47f1b1bd6d3a37c750ecc9a27face015d7f61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/commits/bdad40446cac29d7e2bb290fd425f0bcd3ed9aa6","verification":{"payload":"tree c0d47f1b1bd6d3a37c750ecc9a27face015d7f61\nparent 61859ac6b08dc6088401c33f0b3ed9d84074c94f\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789849574 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789849574 +1200\n\nci: no changelog file (#189)\n\nNobody reads a changelog file here; the GitHub release carries the\nsame lines, generated from the same notes. release-please wrote one by\ndefault, and the shape GitHub''s notes come in failed prettier on every\nrelease commit — CI does not run on a release PR opened with\nGITHUB_TOKEN, so it showed on master. The file goes, and release-please\nis told not to keep one.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqru/mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEMMQADrdhCWuGwLBDgYl09KmcJnD\n+fr96yx9VKmdq1r7VW7Kd8eGq2rJJQKDpbhK5x2tEXHc32zeZPFGikW9QeVHg3MM\nxgBXN9seqpAgoA3oazhhiWKufpf0bLGCKnCBlndLCOzqIMklhUT4oYlB2AqF0CCo\nxQntZ80ccxghOPRjDUSBvwirHp4A9clvCsTdSWwxh8JalbPvgx7SJdjSAHE8EQl9\nEskLzNIRdBnIgpESGgokN4xIEHJwD4fGIbT8R3OQCNzvkgcNkqCPjKWxYdXlcgqE\nTyET1plCKWctAewHuRZG/QlsgWPopoTnltH6dIyOZ+dHfgJCh5toSbstNTTrb7A9\nkv91aQE5CyVTBdc7+EKp84iyZt3wczlqJLj+kupvANa8rHS4A2X3MoCmMxXHbI0F\njB7ZZcm6Mu23gZWHtTJATkAclUlwS4f3jegLJaKRWFxyw/0n4uZ3AsUHdh8lvrqO\n2ltaoA1AjESuzPC7AliN6XUWFcIEpPFY7hP5CWKv2oKYol30Wo5r+YTAahRvNjER\n0qHegun4deR/zUzvNwfvot2gBjHoVn/bjZhTT4+VoMrh1UbBOptlK2d+wBQ/HPNW\nxEBpVMNCvrjnJdktIni+ALOC15woJfp+O2XEBvqFC+KJPBZDANdwi2aXdHen2tQk\n1Paok09W0usHdDAO/Wlo\n=Ou5v\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T20:26:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198