e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/commits/bf301db2d2c2a5daf9bdf56bf8fe270f606a8ffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T01:17:56Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T01:17:56Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"refactor(plugin): rename the plugin to \"QuestDB ORIGINAL\"\n\nThe plugin was surfaced under two different names: signalk.displayName\nin package.json drove the App Store card and plugin list, while\nplugin.name drove the config panel header and status rows. Renaming\nonly one of them would leave a user installing \"QuestDB ORIGINAL\" and\nthen finding \"QuestDB History\" in their plugin config.\n\nRename plugin.name to match, and update the two WAL repair messages\nthat tell the user which panel to open — those name the panel the user\nhas to locate, so a stale name there is a dead end mid-recovery.","tree":{"sha":"a000ca242dec46bbc1928bfd2b936c50a7496468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/trees/a000ca242dec46bbc1928bfd2b936c50a7496468"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/commits/bf301db2d2c2a5daf9bdf56bf8fe270f606a8ffa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url