,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/commits/56684feacdb0a3f69b717cd5cf5af5d8d582781a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:40:21Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:40:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: stop promoting itself as default history provider on every start (#145)\n\nSince signalk-server 2.31.0 (SignalK/signalk-server#2837) the default\nHistory API provider is persisted in historyApi.defaultProvider, chosen\nunder Data → Preferences, and resolved independently of plugin load\norder. The 5-second-after-start POST to\n/signalk/v2/api/history/_providers/_default/signalk-questdb therefore no\nlonger fixes anything, and it fought that feature: on servers without\nsecurity it rewrote an operator''s persisted choice on every restart, and\non servers with security enabled it was rejected (401) and only ever\nproduced a debug line.\n\nRemove the POST; document how the default is chosen and that servers\n< 2.31 fall back to first-registered.","tree":{"sha":"d325f8c807e5e14f6ba255f24b5e02da32d0ea34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/trees/d325f8c807e5e14f6ba255f24b5e02da32d0ea34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dirkwa/signalk-questdb/git/commits/56684feacdb0a3f69b717cd5cf5af5d8d582781a","verification":{"payload":"tree d325f8c807e5e14f6ba255f24b5e02da32d0ea34\nparent cde40b42fbf3700d76c8c2e8a26d7c331d280edb\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1786945221 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786945221 +1200\n\nfix: stop promoting itself as default history provider on every start (#145)\n\nSince signalk-server 2.31.0 (SignalK/signalk-server#2837) the default\nHistory API provider is persisted in historyApi.defaultProvider, chosen\nunder Data → Preferences, and resolved independently of plugin load\norder. The 5-second-after-start POST to\n/signalk/v2/api/history/_providers/_default/signalk-questdb therefore no\nlonger fixes anything, and it fought that feature: on servers without\nsecurity it rewrote an operator''s persisted choice on every restart, and\non servers with security enabled it was rejected (401) and only ever\nproduced a debug line.\n\nRemove the POST; document how the default is chosen and that servers\n< 2.31 fall back to first-registered.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgp7FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALRoQAH8eriFT5NhX3VHYjoYnxLX/\nb7souByvAH6HHOzOfi6I1+iEaU9ibdj6G9GSx9iJLsxCNV8lvHZlDx3awD8v2t5U\nbRSbGbBwiLM/QNjBh2T0HxEA5XQoanMjtn8ZEDS+pxUSnSszz+/ALosmwLmYAdYO\nvkxBeK/2yefBUIZy/OnUB2l5Uq4P5/PEOAeoiKNZdDKnmKxscSQ8cSkIYv38PlBc\na0o8PZlFy9Em4AyrACIZ8996kl+jaqGSClgxCRYPWnQDbagw4V0zeygzKpbpKGSU\nhPDkPee8AP1jpd6rgxDM0C0seNRLBLK/xr2KeIJSNxy/zNF/JYhVWkRLJIpimI7Z\nBEreg+Gz8th+LJiiUjHgL5qNzztOX2Ia9jtjFj7ekvK7kTxqadhcbmxu9rTT3Apl\nD8Pl180k812LWIy2A+cvKhHRFeu0rd+FC+/wnmJ6hhweAsmODwz+tfvIjoY+IoMA\n/5Uw5yFyphrL+JsXoUKdnH9QSEa+IJyaibVxhMpqbk8HNI84YUet7pH1wLCJWDL+\njNWmwM0y8WhJ4kuopjPZkt8ZlQuViVfKpO/Rgn/XJXZVUoiB+vakmEfhJOe9bBh+\ntwwKbPyGHEuM63R6wDlL69eeE1iFhEcXcwsUCN2oI8OEzTHoWrKLwKs8yBIKw862\nPx61qfjhFnDcDIfaOu/c\n=ixRw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T05:40:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/g