l":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/commits/efc71d9f6e312f3e45ea6f4a1642b7fa709fea9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T00:38:16Z","email":"149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nelson Riera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T00:38:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add project screenshots (Challenge Tracker + Ledger) and mobile guards (#9)\n\n* feat: wire ledger MFE remote into portfolio host\n\nAdds the `ledger/App` remote alongside `challengeTracker/App`:\n- `vite.config.ts` registers `ledger` against `VITE_LEDGER_TRACKER_URL`\n  (defaults to `http://localhost:4002`).\n- `.env.example` documents the new variable.\n- `src/types/remotes.d.ts` declares the `ledger/App` module so TS resolves\n  the lazy import.\n- `src/App.tsx` lazy-imports `ledger/App`, adds a `/projects/ledger/*`\n  route under an `ErrorBoundary` with a Ledger-specific fallback, and\n  extends the full-screen route check to cover it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add project screenshots + mobile guards to portfolio\n\n- Add real dashboard screenshots for the Challenge Tracker and Ledger FeaturedProject cards (previously a [Screenshot] placeholder) and wire them via screenshotSrc.\n\n- Add viewport-fit=cover and a 16px form-field rule on small screens (covers the federated remotes) to prevent iOS focus auto-zoom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nelson Riera <nelsonriera@MacBook-Pro-de-Nelson.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a259d5ea740a22d540fe39933f6be8bf723a1ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/trees/a259d5ea740a22d540fe39933f6be8bf723a1ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/commits/efc71d9f6e312f3e45ea6f4a1642b7fa709fea9b","verification":{"payload":"tree a259d5ea740a22d540fe39933f6be8bf723a1ac6\nparent a717b9abb55d798410523c577f4baa0130f15f30\nauthor Nelson Riera <149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com> 1782175096 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782175096 -0600\n\nAdd project screenshots (Challenge Tracker + Ledger) and mobile guards (#9)\n\n* feat: wire ledger MFE remote into portfolio host\n\nAdds the `ledger/App` remote alongside `challengeTracker/App`:\n- `vite.config.ts` registers `ledger` against `VITE_LEDGER_TRACKER_URL`\n  (defaults to `http://localhost:4002`).\n- `.env.example` documents the new variable.\n- `src/types/remotes.d.ts` declares the `ledger/App` module so TS resolves\n  the lazy import.\n- `src/App.tsx` lazy-imports `ledger/App`, adds a `/projects/ledger/*`\n  route under an `ErrorBoundary` with a Ledger-specific fallback, and\n  extends the full-screen route check to cover it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add project screenshots + mobile guards to portfolio\n\n- Add real dashboard screenshots for the Challenge Tracker and Ledger FeaturedProject cards (previously a [Screenshot] placeholder) and wire them via screenshotSrc.\n\n- Add viewport-fit=cover and a 16px form-field rule on small screens (covers the federated remotes) to prevent iOS focus auto-zoom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nelson Riera <nelsonriera@MacBook-Pro-de-Nelson.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 