/NelsonSDE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/commits/319c52bf04c0ad856ce7033a9d5f1708cf8c3ded/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T17:16:22Z","email":"149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nelson Riera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T17:16:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: add npm start script for federation-aware dev (#7)\n\nModule Federation requires a built remoteEntry.js, which only exists\nafter vite build. The dev mode (npm run dev) breaks the host→tracker\nremote handshake because Vite''s SPA fallback returns index.html for\nthe missing JS bundle.\n\nThe new start script runs an initial build, then keeps vite build\n--watch and vite preview in parallel via concurrently. Source changes\nauto-rebuild dist/ and the preview server picks them up on browser\nrefresh — no HMR, but federation works end-to-end without remembering\nto build first.\n\nCo-authored-by: Nelson Riera <nelsonriera@MacBook-Pro-de-Nelson.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"849e6638af16512cd6ed6a8ed76c3a2d4c176e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/trees/849e6638af16512cd6ed6a8ed76c3a2d4c176e43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/commits/319c52bf04c0ad856ce7033a9d5f1708cf8c3ded","verification":{"payload":"tree 849e6638af16512cd6ed6a8ed76c3a2d4c176e43\nparent 3be25fcf4a4b24cdc02c3e6c750c12baea334de3\nauthor Nelson Riera <149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com> 1777569382 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777569382 -0600\n\nchore: add npm start script for federation-aware dev (#7)\n\nModule Federation requires a built remoteEntry.js, which only exists\nafter vite build. The dev mode (npm run dev) breaks the host→tracker\nremote handshake because Vite''s SPA fallback returns index.html for\nthe missing JS bundle.\n\nThe new start script runs an initial build, then keeps vite build\n--watch and vite preview in parallel via concurrently. Source changes\nauto-rebuild dist/ and the preview server picks them up on browser\nrefresh — no HMR, but federation works end-to-end without remembering\nto build first.\n\nCo-authored-by: Nelson Riera <nelsonriera@MacBook-Pro-de-Nelson.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp845mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5EIQAEUd9wYnpHukhjBc5DJvg/wI\nDOWzGvpdY2qa+eWZMgmrDNbz4O+kRifs8fSNpI9K8fovZxVsFNrb8hmz6N+b3Kh9\nM3K3xsIPCX7b3c/UdDaG+QxG5YHqIk28Rvsj3icxHDBHLYORjHlzNIf3AGkiJTsf\noMGzxcCxt0KyNb5vt57hWXyjYwMrTmTjjdyo9qmlOgX5qFkBclDZaY1xyQxBmP/A\nxZbKHonZ2L3WkgMj4oqYZs+wg6263BeBvdBSQ44Ln/yzJt9prvBmBjmKBKAcAGzo\nK7QkolcF/rfVSfIWKQXwvwrljLd/4p9D4+VgXDjmbrEnUTOFVApQ1sTOvoo328/1\n1kyxaIEIUgLxUIbvISud0HZ7QSX7xkBbtf4fYbQDyGHZyf+0XjboCuZBc7Riw8DY\nAROXi4rFDjrYYcBlNYGaZgihUYt3RMTSiGiwT2Q9VlUVL78XmnCHsxx/QqaR5bXX\nh9y95VpEdpkUPQdTJgnyGSiSLgjLwr1ngjozkrOL9bLK39WLXn99VJz6uNPWyLGK\nvjYKf1zZG9tA4uMMQKGO/pgNGQn8odr3sAHuPPy1+v+0vT4zyAcL+1ubiQhCwKX3\nOmxDIoa1rsfzxem8F1wjgJl+8gi6tXKV7UW9t+OPgeqm3qKYvf7P/Bzpu7nZ1wBT\n16rR6+Cl6err+fASGsOf\n=CIAd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-30T17:16:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events"