thub.com/users/NelsonSDE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/commits/e7175e077bcc3ea0743d1a315bb3f6fa828a6d7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T15:40:24Z","email":"149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nelson Riera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T15:40:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove unused dependencies and dead CSS file (#3)\n\n* Fixing issue\n\n* chore: remove unused dependencies and dead CSS file\n\n- Remove axios (never imported in portfolio-host)\n- Remove zustand (no state store used in portfolio-host)\n- Delete src/App.css (comment-only file, no actual styles)\n- Remove App.css import from App.tsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove zustand from Module Federation shared list\n\nvite-plugin-federation resolves shared deps at build time even if unused,\ncausing ENOENT crash after zustand was uninstalled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: use oxc minifier instead of esbuild (Vite 8 compat)\n\nVite 8 dropped esbuild as a bundled dependency. minify: true uses\nthe new default oxc minifier which is included with Vite 8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"868236d67552af4cd5a33db4bf946c37c536d1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/trees/868236d67552af4cd5a33db4bf946c37c536d1f8"},"url":"https://api.githu