ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NelsonSDE","id":149415820,"login":"NelsonSDE","node_id":"U_kgDOCOfnjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NelsonSDE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/commits/9d4413a17e53b63139b4225b9d4ace7c6c71f321/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T21:31:03Z","email":"149415820+NelsonSDE@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nelson Riera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T21:31:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: remove dead api.ts with localStorage token vulnerability (#2)\n\nThe api.ts file stored JWT tokens in localStorage, making them vulnerable\nto XSS attacks. This file was orphaned after removing the custom auth\nsystem - no files imported it. The challenge-tracker remote app has its\nown Clerk-based api.ts that handles tokens securely.\n\nRemoved:\n- src/lib/api.ts (dead code with localStorage.setItem/getItem for tokens)\n- src/lib/ directory (now empty)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce20ad678f548c0718c22a91d975474cd7d52437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NelsonSDE-Portfolio/portfolio-host/git/trees/ce20ad678f548c0718c22a91d975474cd7d52437"},"url":"https://api.github.com/