.com/users/keithvassallomt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/commits/960856b1df38518ffe5892c8b156e52b3bd4a5e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:01:20Z","email":"keith@vassallo.cloud","name":"Keith Vassallo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:01:20Z","email":"keith@vassallo.cloud","name":"Keith Vassallo"},"message":"feat(wakeword): offer a retrained Hey Ari as a trial wake word\n\nIssue 21''s capture held 51 false wakes in three weeks, and the shipped\nhey_ari fires on 50 of them at LOW and 36 even at 0.985. No ladder fixes\nthat, so this is a retrain, added beside hey_ari rather than replacing it.\n\nScored on material it never trained on: the 25 household false wakes from\n28 September on, the 92 marked takes from four speakers, and 7.3 hours of\nCommon Voice and AudioSet test splits. At each of hey_ari''s three levels its\ncutoff hears as many takes as hey_ari does, and fires on 2-4 of the 25 false\nwakes where hey_ari fires on all 25. Two repeat runs of the same recipe agree.\n\nIt breaks the registry''s rule: the kitchen ambient peaks at 0.999 for this\nmodel and it fires once in those ten minutes at every level. Hence an option\nfor a phone trial, not the default.\n\nModel and training notes live in ari-tools/wakeword/trained/hey_ari-r6b/,\nwhich is gitignored.\n\nRefs #21\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af537993ecd1f2b4682549d9df10abbe00b36407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/git/trees/af537993ecd1f2b4682549d9df10abbe00b36407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/git/commits/960856b1df38518ffe5892c8b156e52b3bd4a5e2","verification":{"payload":"tree af537993ecd1f2b4682549d9df10abbe00b36407\nparent 408b9897eb1f32c9941c262ebd7383eb47042594\nauthor Keith Vassallo <keith@vassallo.cloud> 1791280880 +0100\ncommitter Keith Vassallo <keith@vassallo.cloud> 1791280880 +0100\n\nfeat(wakeword): offer a retrained Hey Ari as a trial wake word\n\nIssue 21''s capture held 51 false wakes in three weeks, and the shipped\nhey_ari fires on 50 of them at LOW and 36 even at 0.985. No ladder fixes\nthat, so this is a retrain, added beside hey_ari rather than replacing it.\n\nScored on material it never trained on: the 25 household false wakes from\n28 September on, the 92 marked takes from four speakers, and 7.3 hours of\nCommon Voice and AudioSet test splits. At each of hey_ari''s three levels its\ncutoff hears as many takes as hey_ari does, and fires on 2-4 of the 25 false\nwakes where hey_ari fires on all 25. Two repeat runs of the same recipe agree.\n\nIt breaks the registry''s rule: the kitchen ambient peaks at 0.999 for this\nmodel and it fires once in those ten minutes at every level. Hence an option\nfor a phone trial, not the default.\n\nModel and training notes live in ari-tools/wakeword/trained/hey_ari-r6b/,\nwhich is gitignored.\n\nRefs #21\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBwuNMZ9IHCIvq+SKh0ksD1v+0n\n2JyY0wAMl9Z5mLJ/QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK4UY3Q5nvPUDtI1xNtlcWdQhc3gO04HGaVzXB2yYSZoZF9c3k+CJ3pOFAGwCLrnep\nHGwd0t86gcx5rZEZnZ4wU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T10:01:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5295061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co