","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithvassallomt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/commits/408b9897eb1f32c9941c262ebd7383eb47042594/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:35:09Z","email":"keith@vassallo.cloud","name":"Keith Vassallo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:35:09Z","email":"keith@vassallo.cloud","name":"Keith Vassallo"},"message":"copy(listening): say what the place-fence options actually do\n\nThe old wording described the mechanism, which nobody choosing between them\ncares about. The choice is Google Play Services or not, and what it costs in\nbattery and in how fast a fix arrives.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc7d4cd133de6e0cb66a2afd96723ad31b483db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/git/trees/bc7d4cd133de6e0cb66a2afd96723ad31b483db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ari-digital-assistant/ari-android/git/commits/408b9897eb1f32c9941c262ebd7383eb47042594","verification":{"payload":"tree bc7d4cd133de6e0cb66a2afd96723ad31b483db2\nparent 4012710ceb02d242292410a2babc453c826027ea\nauthor Keith Vassallo <keith@vassallo.cloud> 1790062509 +0100\ncommitter Keith Vassallo <keith@vassallo.cloud> 1790062509 +0100\n\ncopy(listening): say what the place-fence options actually do\n\nThe old wording described the mechanism, which nobody choosing between them\ncares about. The choice is Google Play Services or not, and what it costs in\nbattery and in how fast a fix arrives.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBwuNMZ9IHCIvq+SKh0ksD1v